"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"NearlCrews","providerType":"User"},"email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"authoredDate":"2026-07-06T15:56:01Z","committedDate":"2026-07-06T15:56:01Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"NearlCrews","providerType":"User"},"email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:07:39.810Z","repositoryId":1246158877,"sha":"836e75f2353f1ce3439dcb1f37a274d50a935a7e"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:07:39.810Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/c0eef05a2fa1119ec026729f59630916725c231f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:29:10Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:29:10Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"ci: move plugin CI to the 2026-10-04 master commit and drop the retired armv7 input\n\nThe reusable Signal K plugin CI removed its armv7 (Cerbo GX) Node 20 job\nupstream. At master faab2be the enable-armv7 input is accepted but ignored\nand defaults to false. The previous pin, 0495a4a, defaulted it to true, so\nthe input could not simply be deleted; the pin moves and the input goes.\n\nEvery other input this caller passes keeps its name, type, and default. The\nonly other change between the two pins replaces npm 10.9.x with npm 11 on the\nNode 22 desktop and integration lanes. The plugin CI now runs Node 22 and 24\nonly, so the Node 20 leg in ci.yml is the only Node 20 coverage and no CI\nexercises 32-bit ARM. engines.node is unchanged. The comments and maintainer\ndocs that described the armv7 lane, or npm 10 on the plugin CI Node 22 lanes,\nnow state this.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"430d89b341ca7c1b69ec909c93e8bfcd179579f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/430d89b341ca7c1b69ec909c93e8bfcd179579f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/c0eef05a2fa1119ec026729f59630916725c231f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commit/c0eef05a2fa1119ec026729f59630916725c231f","node_id":"C_kwDOSkbgHdoAKGMwZWVmMDVhMmZhMTExOWVjMDI2NzI5ZjU5NjMwOTE2NzI1YzIzMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commit/e7793792f58f16aae7d91b6160685aa466d8fb60","sha":"e7793792f58f16aae7d91b6160685aa466d8fb60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/e7793792f58f16aae7d91b6160685aa466d8fb60"}],"sha":"c0eef05a2fa1119ec026729f59630916725c231f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/c0eef05a2fa1119ec026729f59630916725c231f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/e7793792f58f16aae7d91b6160685aa466d8fb60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T04:45:53Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T04:45:53Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"docs(panel): describe how the Admin echoes a saved configuration\n\nThe doc comment on the unconfigured flag said the Signal K Admin passes\na null or undefined configuration for a plugin that was never configured\nand does not send the prop again after the panel''s save. Both claims\nwere wrong or inexact. The Admin passes undefined for a plugin that was\nnever configured, and {} only for a package that sets\nsignalk-plugin-enabled-by-default to true, which this one does not.\nAfter a save, EmbeddedPluginConfigurationForm, unchanged from 2.24.0\nthrough 2.33.0 and master, hands the saved object straight back as the\nprop without awaiting the request, and keeps it when the request fails.\n\nThe comment now states both, and why the flag clears on the panel''s own\nrequest: the echo is the panel''s own value, not confirmation. No\nbehavior changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eed01debbb8f0f42fb911840d6dbe5f8a7c3e120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/eed01debbb8f0f42fb911840d6dbe5f8a7c3e120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/e7793792f58f16aae7d91b6160685aa466d8fb60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxN