,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/afebe1a65017b7a5f1067a543036f41cb18448f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:56:05Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:56:05Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"ci: wait up to four minutes for registry metadata after publishing\n\nThe post-publish check gave npm sixty seconds to serve the new version and failed a healthy publish on propagation lag, so the loop now retries for four minutes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"6cc7003b1e754e998c6a663540e3416b77860f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/6cc7003b1e754e998c6a663540e3416b77860f58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/afebe1a65017b7a5f1067a543036f41cb18448f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commit/afebe1a65017b7a5f1067a543036f41cb18448f0","node_id":"C_kwDOSkbgHdoAKGFmZWJlMWE2NTAxN2I3YTVmMTA2N2E1NDMwMzZmNDFjYjE4NDQ4ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commit/4f9c3ca8c7f04a432662ebfb9c336ed4e9db81bf","sha":"4f9c3ca8c7f04a432662ebfb9c336ed4e9db81bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/4f9c3ca8c7f04a432662ebfb9c336ed4e9db81bf"}],"sha":"afebe1a65017b7a5f1067a543036f41cb18448f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/afebe1a65017b7a5f1067a543036f41cb18448f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/4f9c3ca8c7f04a432662ebfb9c336ed4e9db81bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:46:12Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:46:12Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"release: prepare 0.18.0\n\nFolds the pending panel work into a dated 0.18.0 entry. The release is a\nminor because the configuration panel renames controls an operator reads:\nthe theme toggle now offers Match Admin, Match device, Light, Dark, and\nNight, and the save bar reports its four states in new words.\n\nIt also carries the keyboard fixes that came with the shared UI update. A\nsave the panel refuses keeps Save and Discard in the tab order and names\nthe reason beside them, and focus lands on the Plugin status heading when\na poll clears the recent errors under a focused button.\n\nMoves the README \"What''s new\" section, the supported-version table in the\nsecurity policy, and the changelog compare links to the new version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"2df0eef10dbd068099f2841bf70f7907b7a625f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/2df0eef10dbd068099f2841bf70f7907b7a625f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/4f9c3ca8c7f04a432662ebfb9c336ed4e9db81bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQ