:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/ab3e1f8fef672a298ccc57a62bdd9e32f62769f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:53Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:53Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"build: narrow the panel size gate''s growth allowance\n\nThe gate allows a percentage over the recorded figure, so re-recording a\nlarger baseline widened the room before it next trips: 10% of the pre-upgrade\n45,258 bytes was 4,526, and 10% of the 55,950 the shared UI update brought is\n5,595. Every upgrade absorbed that way made the next one easier to absorb.\n\nThe growth itself is the library''s: a webpack module report over the built\nremote puts it inside the package''s own graph, the shell group and the style\nmodules it installs, none of which the panel can decline. So the figure stands\nand the allowance drops to 5%, which is roughly 2.8 KB and still ample for\nordinary panel work.\n\nThe description beside it no longer repeats the pinned version or the previous\nmeasurement, both of which live where they are checked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"e812127e9ee780e8e28c386a239f3d5d5694d4f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/e812127e9ee780e8e28c386a239f3d5d5694d4f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/ab3e1f8fef672a298ccc57a62bdd9e32f62769f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"ve