id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/0da78ba08366a6da92569040af940f316d4fe3c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:35Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:35Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test(browser): scroll through one helper before clicking or checking\n\nThe coarse-pointer sweep carried two answers to the sticky save bar: the\ndisclosure loop scrolled with scrollIntoViewIfNeeded and the toggle loop\ntwenty lines below it scrolled to the viewport centre through an in-page\nevaluate, whose parameter was named for the rectangle that the same test\nmeasures later. Both loops now call one helper that records why the scroll is\nthere, and the toggle loop resolves its set once instead of re-querying the\nselector on every iteration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"c89d50fccb7291f7bbfcbeb3b0d12298f307c99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/c89d50fccb7291f7bbfcbeb3b0d12298f307c99c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/0da78ba08366a6da92569040af940f316d4fe3c4","verification":{"paylo