,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/03e7099f23b9af48af8bdb101b6cedff2510f82c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:19Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:19Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test(browser): load the default fixture only where a test uses it\n\nThe shared setup mounted the default fixture for every test, and eight of the\nseventeen threw that mount away by navigating to a different fixture as their\nfirst action, the coarse-pointer sweep among them. Each wasted mount is a\nnavigation, a federated remote fetch, and a React render, once per browser\nproject. The setup now registers only the console and page-error handlers,\nand each test opens the fixture it needs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"9c6c1afa5c43fe53e933f0f12c97fecabf68ef83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/9c6c1afa5c43fe53e933f0f12c97fecabf68ef83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/03e7099f23b9af48af8bdb101b6cedff2510f82c","verification