er_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/5f3b52a1555b5840b59103cd00140be2b52fdc77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:03Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:03:03Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test(browser): name the shared UI copy the panel spec matches on\n\n\"Match Admin\", \"Match device\", and \"Save sent to the server\" are default\nstrings the shared UI owns, and the panel passes no overrides, so they were\nspread through the spec as six literals plus a test title. A package rewording\ntherefore read as a locator that matched nothing. They are named once at the\ntop of the file now, the save bar''s status is picked out by the action bar''s\nown status element rather than by its sentence, and the theme test is titled\nfor the property it proves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"74ec10d8de474fb67d17d7acae6f188714fc2c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/74ec10d8de474fb67d17d7acae6f188714fc2c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/sign