followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/74faf673c85bf27d9b19c190aa72ecda5d68f05c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:02:42Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:02:42Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test: drop the copied label table from the save bar rules test\n\nThe test asserts one thing, which rows of the save bar''s disable rule are\nenabled, and the rule never reads a label. The fixture carried a seven-key\ncopy of the package''s label record anyway, so a rename inside the package\nedited a test whose assertions did not change meaning. The resolver now falls\nback to the package''s own labels, which is what the rendered bar shows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"d732870b512a899a5a00d6b7998896109b83f657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/d732870b512a899a5a00d6b7998896109b83f657"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/74faf673c85bf2