l":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/aafc186be1cb0c1e01dd178146674c31a0b84776/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:02:26Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:02:26Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor(panel): name the recent-error focus ref after the prop it feeds\n\nThe ref that catches focus when the recent-error banner goes travelled under\nthree names: `headingRef` where it is created, `focusFallbackRef` across the\nprops of the banner component, and `dismissFocusRef` at the shared `Banner`\nit is handed to, which is also the name the doc comment above the component\nused. It now carries the shared prop''s name throughout, so the comment\ndescribes a name the file uses.\n\nIts type comes from `BannerProps[''dismissFocusRef'']` rather than from a local\n`RefObject<HTMLHeadingElement | null>`, so the prop tracks the component it\nfeeds instead of pinning it to the element the panel happens to focus today.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"75c0452cb4f91ec270ff3bf550ec2264f51982c6","url":"https://api.github.com