_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/2a206e8e04304bc4e34b4678b78b353f9fefee5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:39:48Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:39:48Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"docs: drop the implementation plans for shipped work\n\nThe three plans under docs/superpowers/plans tracked the restructure into\ninput and output modules, the multi-source OpenSeaMap work, and the USCG Light\nList with NOAA ENC Direct. All three shipped, and the module map in CLAUDE.md,\nthe development guide, and the changelog now describe what landed, so the\ntask checklists no longer describe anything true of the code.\n\nThe dated design specs beside them stay as the record of why each was built\nthe way it was, and so do the two route-draft plans, which carry their own\nnote that they describe a feature removed in 0.12.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"a819541ea5f4717ffe4756fc46e39393f12e4037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nearl