noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:43:16Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"fix(panel): drop the strict React share check the Admin cannot satisfy\n\nSignal K 2.24.0''s Admin bundles React 19.2.4 but registers its\nfederation share with a hardcoded 19.0.0. strictVersion compared the\nrequired ^19.2.0 against that registered version, so the check rejected\na fully compatible host, and with import: false there is no bundled\nfallback: the panel never mounted on 2.24.x, the documented minimum.\n\nThe shares keep singleton, requiredVersion ^19.2.0, and import: false;\na range mismatch is a console warning again. The contract test pins the\nnew shape, and the changelog and README now describe the singleton\nsharing without the strict claim.","tree":{"sha":"31d130f5392155371a69067a977f7048ac76730b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/31d130f5392155371a69067a977f7048ac76730b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/a4c943f2e22f7fd213ddfe507bdb9a59a4415f46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http