:"2026-08-24T03:27:58Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T03:27:58Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"ci: pin LF line endings for the Windows format check\n\nThe plugin workflow''s newly declared format check fails on both Windows\nlanes: the runner checks out with autocrlf, prettier''s default endOfLine\nis lf, and every file in the repository gets flagged. A .gitattributes\npins LF at checkout, with the binary assets marked so nothing rewrites\nthem. The tree is already LF throughout, so renormalization changes\nnothing.","tree":{"sha":"d79911cae90986f2bcf78213c4633b36fb348a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/d79911cae90986f2bcf78213c4633b36fb348a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/2406f30c4c66e252399b88cdc442e20b4620b3d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCr