i.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/00235457e9fbd1061f88ff4fe0e7b3e5952abb2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:06:54Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:06:54Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"fix(wpi): cool down after a failed full-set download\n\nThe refresh gate remembered only successful fetches, so once the NGA\nendpoint started failing, every chartplotter list poll (arriving every\nsecond or two) launched a fresh multi-megabyte download and logged a new\nerror; a live outage serves 503s Akamai caches for ten minutes, so those\nretries could never succeed. A failed download now starts a ten-minute\ncool-down during which list polls serve the last known ports (the\nin-session set, or hydrated disk data as a stale serve), detail misses\nskip the upstream without recording an unearned success, and the\nrecorded failure stands. The first list after the cool-down retries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c8dfc3a75a3b17fd8a305e04e9d24ca0d4a44f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/0c8dfc3a75a3b17fd8a305e04e9d24ca0d4a44f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/00235457e9fbd1061f88ff4fe0e7b3e5952abb2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ