rl":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/59bbf8ad5d26f1d31f5eea17dce02a2fec06493d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T17:12:37Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T17:12:37Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"fix(panel): actually type-check panel sources and fix surfaced errors\n\ntsconfig.panel.json inherited the base config''s exclude, which lists\nsrc/panel so the Node build skips it. Exclude does not merge across\nextends, so the panel config''s include was emptied and the panel\ntype-check compiled zero files. Override exclude locally; the program\nnow covers the panel sources.\n\nFix the errors that coverage surfaces: narrow DataSourceCard''s cardId\nand onToggleExpanded to SourceSlug so the accordion''s typed handlers\nassign cleanly, and add the override modifiers ErrorBoundary''s\ncomponentDidCatch and render need under noImplicitOverride.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdb0631083b1c4766e679c0d306ecd6a43593c83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/bdb0631083b1c4766e679c0d306ecd6a43593c83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/59bbf8ad5d26f1d31f5eea17dce02a2fec06493d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ne