ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/commits/59e2dea7411dcfe9a032da406599643a2bcd92f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T17:06:18Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T17:06:18Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"build(deps): update signalk-nearlcrews-ui to 0.4.1 and refresh dependencies\n\nBump the shared UI package to 0.4.1 (brightened Night theme tokens,\ncheckbox indeterminate support, additive TextInput date and time types).\nMove the Babel toolchain to 8.x, dropping the removed isTSX and\nallExtensions preset options now that JSX parsing keys off the .tsx\nextension. Refresh react, react-dom, webpack, and fast-uri within range,\nand record the new UI version in the third-party notices, README,\nCLAUDE.md, and the development guide.\n\nESLint stays at 9 (neostandard peers to eslint ^9), which also holds the\nremaining dev-only minimatch advisories; runtime dependencies audit\nclean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"285e881afd5e87b3538f30f07f2ff0353774704a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/trees/285e881afd5e87b3538f30f07f2ff0353774704a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-crows-nest/git/commits/59e2dea7411dcfe9a032da406599643a2bcd92f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":