to-adventure/commits/63125721772758232e362329527aa495e823781b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T03:35:00Z","email":"edward.monteiro@gmail.com","name":"Edward Monteiro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T03:35:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix fill-row alignment + add per-day playground convention (#4)\n\nTwo issues, both fixed at the source so every future day inherits:\n\n1. The \"Check / Verificar\" button was visually misaligned with the\n   input on the fill-in question. The button had no vertical padding\n   while the input had 12px, so flex stretch was inconsistent across\n   browsers. Now both share the same vertical padding, the button has\n   flex: 0 0 auto + white-space: nowrap so it never wraps or squishes,\n   and on narrow screens the row stacks vertically.\n\n2. Each day now has a required \"playground\" section between the\n   visual and the quiz: one small day-specific interactive widget,\n   not graded, no XP, just feel. For day01 the existing molecule SVG\n   becomes the playground — clicking O or H reveals a fact card.\n\nThe shared CSS (.playground, .playground-output, .atom-clickable, the\nfixed .fill-row) lives in day01/style.css which the _TEMPLATE and all\nfuture days import via @import. The convention is documented in\nCLAUDE.md (\"Playground\" section) and the _TEMPLATE has scaffolding for\nplay.title / play.hint / play.intro strings and a setupPlayground(dict)\nstub in lesson.js.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WBYSnQ74zEP72MsqKMgrTE\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3d0c4ebe0f23134339b7a4c51067dc3979da956","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edwardmonteiro/super-duper-octo-adventure/git/trees/b3d0c4ebe0f23134339b7a4c51067dc3979da956"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edwardmonteiro/super-duper-octo-adventure/git/commits/63125721772758232e362329527aa495e823781b","verification":{"payload":"tree b3d0c4ebe0f23134339b7a4c51067dc3979da956\nparent b95ac7237fbcf7027bfa8b90b16018feeb908e06\nauthor Edward Monteiro <edward.monteiro@gmail.com> 1779420900 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779420900 -0300\n\nFix fill-row alignment + add per-day playground convention (#4)\n\nTwo issues, both fixed at the source so every future day inherits:\n\n1. The \"Check / Verificar\" button was visually misaligned with the\n   input on the fill-in question. The button had no vertical padding\n   while the input had 12px, so flex stretch was inconsistent across\n   browsers. Now both share the same vertical padding, the button has\n   flex: 0 0 auto + white-space: nowrap so it never wraps or squishes,\n   and on narrow screens the row stacks vertically.\n\n2. Each day now has a required \"playground\" section between the\n   visual and the quiz: one small day-specific interactive widget,\n   not graded, no XP, just feel. For day01 the existing molecule SVG\n   becomes the playground — clicking O or H reveals a fact card.\n\nThe shared CSS (.playground, .playground-output, .atom-clickable, the\nfixed .fill-row) lives in day01/style.css which the _TEMPLATE and all\nfuture days import via @import. The convention is documented in\nCLAUDE.md (\"Playground\" section) and the _TEMPLATE has scaffolding for\nplay.title / play.hint / play.intro strings and a setupPlayground(dict)\nstub in lesson.js.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WBYSnQ74zEP72MsqKMgrTE\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqD87kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3RUQAF4SgL4/MN8XIVCXdamv8ZZV\nOw18H0pDv2ub1bYm6Yyhcdk9xSJZgr6UfduAo0zfdmUrW53fpRoaYk1EW+j0V4IL\nDFRhy1gZ1A2XGoslEJYcJLzGYJaKtDda8IgyNXFGJE7x/2U0CDC8idB6qli04Mmx\nGKS2RYGiDgOVOYARh3MPalloHv+sch0fpGORxBIosjxi23yIwxbe9qjiY3KTj52k\nqk++ga51Kx5yGxPFcvEhin7Nb+DMiRlQGxYPWR//IR6ewsPNrSh4/QP2gFf6NPTz\n7G40E1QzjEYYaZpNn+2uYVav2DsRUJldmXbCsD9XuGbnoBperfqpESNRtVJgqOfY\nyeszTBDkgNK3y4ouw9fnqQ/d6apnxxU+7g82Z8/EnZPOtGLVEvg3nJduYw8nVjdi\n0