culum arc and the _drafts/\nconvention in CLAUDE.md; updated Journey Log; day02 DRAFT plan\n(motion) lives in days/day01/BUILD.md.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WBYSnQ74zEP72MsqKMgrTE\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68683558f1cace1dc6ed8054bcde594c6177450b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edwardmonteiro/super-duper-octo-adventure/git/trees/68683558f1cace1dc6ed8054bcde594c6177450b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edwardmonteiro/super-duper-octo-adventure/git/commits/b95ac7237fbcf7027bfa8b90b16018feeb908e06","verification":{"payload":"tree 68683558f1cace1dc6ed8054bcde594c6177450b\nparent 6d8544605b02c88ff2dc1845128912ae7254ac9b\nauthor Edward Monteiro <edward.monteiro@gmail.com> 1779420389 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779420389 -0300\n\nDay 01: rewrite for zero-knowledge entry (atoms & molecules) (#3)\n\nThe original Day 01 jumped straight to \"What is a quantum?\" — that\nassumed prior physics vocabulary (energy, photon, wave) the user\ndoesn''t have. Replaced with \"Everything is made of pieces\": atoms,\nscale (5M across a hair), ~100 elements, and molecules. Visual is\nan inline-SVG water molecule with isometric tilt.\n\nThe previous quantum lesson is parked at days/_drafts/quantum-intro/\nto be promoted around day 11 when the curriculum reaches the quantum\nthreshold.\n\nAlso: documented the full 3-phase curriculum arc and the _drafts/\nconvention in CLAUDE.md; updated Journey Log; day02 DRAFT plan\n(motion) lives in days/day01/BUILD.md.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WBYSnQ74zEP72MsqKMgrTE\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqD8zlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwT4QAJhhWsjYo/mDLx0VEKMzH31O\nouDivFLbzqqcyL9/mgJ9Vj/N1eLjgsHUsQqqO31HhOvlcl57ir+i6rai8zjAOuae\nrx3tHu4iVr6puhNcgqHbEac46dqacyLAGsSZk9kE0rZkvp0C8B4UfMawKw3Mnevs\nJPxG255QtcUrbji2VSRwxYyVAX2CXoApe0JDpcd2UVtNBqXPL9UtYuI4TICWXMSr\nMSb2H+qoUEh76fENAWMZmbdd4YU/GJze