 \"What is a ''quantum''?\" — CSS isometric ramp-vs-stair, three\n  bilingual checks, 10 XP, postMessage completion contract.\n- days/_TEMPLATE/ as the seed for future days.\n- Immortality system: per-day BUILD.md journals + Journey Log in\n  CLAUDE.md so future sessions can pick up from cold.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WBYSnQ74zEP72MsqKMgrTE\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80e9778d7727d194660418883dd1a07b464f9b1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edwardmonteiro/super-duper-octo-adventure/git/trees/80e9778d7727d194660418883dd1a07b464f9b1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edwardmonteiro/super-duper-octo-adventure/git/commits/6d8544605b02c88ff2dc1845128912ae7254ac9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 80e9778d7727d194660418883dd1a07b464f9b1e\nparent e2ffd3834bd502e2e535f1061ef1c1558b310949\nauthor Edward Monteiro <edward.monteiro@gmail.com> 1779419632 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779419632 -0300\n\nQuantum Journey: shell + Day 01 + immortality system (#2)\n\nStatic GitHub-Pages micro-frontend course, 15 min/day, bilingual\n(EN + pt-BR), Duolingo-style. Each day is a self-contained folder\nloaded by the root shell in an iframe.\n\n- Shell (index.html + assets/) with sticky header, language toggle,\n  streak, XP, day grid rendered from days/manifest.json, modal-iframe\n  lesson loader, localStorage state.\n- Day 01 \"What is a ''quantum''?\" — CSS isometric ramp-vs-stair, three\n  bilingual checks, 10 XP, postMessage completion contract.\n- days/_TEMPLATE/ as the seed for future days.\n- Immortality system: per-day BUILD.md journals + Journey Log in\n  CLAUDE.md so future sessions can pick up from cold.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WBYSnQ74zEP72MsqKMgrTE\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqD8nwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHGgQAAENGcafsLud76/DZ9krLfof\nGzxMPm5vAb1LGWlxJhKi/+MLVH668xEU1pKYlui2pDO3G7MTDFKxoqH0Y46u1m1p\nSgn