MDI5MDg3MDdhYzZlZDgxODk5NDY1OWQwZDlhNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/b7dd784525547ad178e11c94ff47d2d6322848f6","sha":"b7dd784525547ad178e11c94ff47d2d6322848f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/b7dd784525547ad178e11c94ff47d2d6322848f6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e","sha":"0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e"}],"sha":"866329dda9502908707ac6ed818994659d0d9a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/866329dda9502908707ac6ed818994659d0d9a67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T11:46:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T11:46:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: show the About copy button on plain-HTTP origins\n\nThe button was hidden whenever navigator.clipboard was undefined. That API\nonly exists in a secure context — HTTPS or localhost — so opening the app\non a LAN address over plain HTTP, which is how it gets used on a phone,\nhid the button entirely. The guard treated the common case as the edge case.\n\nAlways render the button and degrade in three steps instead:\n\n  1. navigator.clipboard.writeText where the origin allows it\n  2. a throwaway textarea + document.execCommand(\"copy\"), the only\n     programmatic copy available on a non-secure origin\n  3. if both fail, reveal the report in a read-only textarea so it can\n     still be selected by hand\n\nlegacyCopy focuses the textarea before selecting — execCommand copies the\nfocused selection, and iOS Safari ignores select() without it — then hands\nfocus back so Escape still closes the dialog.\n\nThe success label is now driven by whether a copy actually happened, so a\nblocked copy no longer reports \"Copied\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDcohLpSC7rKWKW3tvQorq","tree":{"sha":"af575bcab30e31ce7932e0f6e61806ecc811fc12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/af575bcab30e31ce7932e0f6e61806ecc811fc12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e","verification":{"payload":"tree af575bcab30e31ce7932e0f6e61806ecc811fc12\nparent 850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785239192 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785239192 +0000\n\nfix: show the About copy button on plain-HTTP origins\n\nThe button was hidden whenever navigator.clipboard was undefined. That API\nonly exists in a secure context — HTTPS or localhost — so opening the app\non a LAN address over plain HTTP, which is how it gets used on a phone,\nhid the button entirely. The guard treated the common case as the edge case.\n\nAlways render the button and degrade in three steps instead:\n\n  1. navigator.clipboard.writeText where the origin allows it\n  2. a throwaway textarea + document.execCommand(\"copy\"), the only\n     programmatic copy available on a non-secure origin\n  3. if both fail, reveal the report in a read-only textarea so it can\n     still be selected by hand\n\nlegacyCopy focuses the textarea before selecting — execCommand copies the\nfocused selection, and iOS Safari ignores select() without it — then hands\nfocus back so Escape still closes the dialog.\n\nThe success label is now driven by whether a copy actually happened, so a\nblocked copy no longer reports \"Copied\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDcohLpSC7rKWKW3tvQorq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFK+IMTG\nivsZkQIGoOS8SiOfRkb8Op+g90TaRqs+uWXSydy74sOePq6z80KoDU+l0WQbdHCheNSgmseCETOe\nVgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-28T11:46:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e","node_id":"C_kwDOSkir09oAKDAyNThhYTIyMzg4YmYyZTgyNTc5YjVhNTBkNjEzOTg0NzE3NDY1MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677","sha":"850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677"}],"sha":"0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/0258aa22388bf2e82579b5a50d6139847174652e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T00:24:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T00:24:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: retag About-dialog follow-ups to the reopened PR\n\nThe branch was renamed to feature/about-version-info to match the\ntype/short-description convention in CLAUDE.md, which meant recreating the\npull request (GitHub''s branch-rename API, which retargets open PRs in\nplace, is not reachable from this environment). Point the TODO.md tags at\nthe surviving PR number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDcohLpSC7rKWKW3tvQorq","tree":{"sha":"4a6abb19022826b30d6c3b6e7f3386ede45e6746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/4a6abb19022826b30d6c3b6e7f3386ede45e6746"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a6abb19022826b30d6c3b6e7f3386ede45e6746\nparent 373b9a5385ddff03eaae1b1aca955d174217243b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785198288 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785198288 +0000\n\ndocs: retag About-dialog follow-ups to the reopened PR\n\nThe branch was renamed to feature/about-version-info to match the\ntype/short-description convention in CLAUDE.md, which meant recreating the\npull request (GitHub''s branch-rename API, which retargets open PRs in\nplace, is not reachable from this environment). Point the TODO.md tags at\nthe surviving PR number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDcohLpSC7rKWKW3tvQorq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBuy/TOQ\nMqO3Wdc8KReQ3D23HhA+wFJfFIkLk8YSEnTYgkBOVJ3hT+Tyh7yqtWRPUYN4sUNop3x6N4GcyL8J\nMQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-28T00:24:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677","node_id":"C_kwDOSkir09oAKDg1MGE0YmY1Mjc2MWQ2MDdjMmZhODkzMWE2MGNiMDgxY2ZiZDY2Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/373b9a5385ddff03eaae1b1aca955d174217243b","sha":"373b9a5385ddff03eaae1b1aca955d174217243b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/373b9a5385ddff03eaae1b1aca955d174217243b"}],"sha":"850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/850a4bf52761d607c2fa8931a60cb081cfbd6677"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/373b9a5385ddff03eaae1b1aca955d174217243b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T00:19:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T00:19:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: About dialog showing app and API version/commit\n\nAdds an ⓘ button in the header that opens a modal reporting the running\nbuild of both halves of the app, so a bug report can name an exact commit\nand a web/API build mismatch is visible rather than mysterious.\n\nBuild metadata comes from `git describe --tags --always --dirty`, computed\nonce on the host by the Makefile and passed down as Docker build args —\nneither build context contains .git, so neither image can shell out to git\nitself. Nothing to bump by hand.\n\n  Makefile → compose build.args\n    ├─ backend/Dockerfile   -ldflags -X   → GET /api/version\n    └─ frontend/Dockerfile  ARG/ENV       → inlined into the bundle\n\nIn both Dockerfiles the ARGs are declared *after* the dependency-install\nstep: BUILD_TIME changes every invocation and would otherwise invalidate\nthat cache layer on every build.\n\n/api/version sits inside the authenticated group. /health stays public for\ncontainer healthchecks; this endpoint names the deployed commit, so there\nis no reason to serve it to anonymous callers.\n\nThe dialog degrades rather than disappears — if the version fetch fails the\nAPI rows read \"unavailable\" and the frontend block still renders. It also\ncloses on Escape, which the existing modals don''t yet do (tracked in\nTODO.md).\n\nAbout.js reads process.env.REACT_APP_* inside getWebBuildInfo() at render\ntime rather than into module-level constants. CRA''s DefinePlugin\nsubstitutes those expressions textually wherever they appear, so the values\nare still compile-time literals, but tests can stub the env without\nre-importing the module — which would hand the component a second React\ninstance and break every hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDcohLpSC7rKWKW3tvQorq","tree":{"sha":"caf9817b99dffc3d65550bf5d088b2a1af8c9144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/caf9817b99dffc3d65550bf5d088b2a1af8c9144"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/373b9a5385ddff03eaae1b1aca955d174217243b","verification":{"payload":"tree caf9817b99dffc3d65550bf5d088b2a1af8c9144\nparent b7dd784525547ad178e11c94ff47d2d6322848f6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785197970 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785197970 +0000\n\nfeat: About dialog showing app and API version/commit\n\nAdds an ⓘ button in the header that opens a modal reporting the running\nbuild of both halves of the app, so a bug report can name an exact commit\nand a web/API build mismatch is visible rather than mysterious.\n\nBuild metadata comes from `git describe --tags --always --dirty`, computed\nonce on the host by the Makefile and passed down as Docker build args —\nneither build context contains .git, so neither image can shell out to git\nitself. Nothing to bump by hand.\n\n  Makefile → compose build.args\n    ├─ backend/Dockerfile   -ldflags -X   → GET /api/version\n    └─ frontend/Dockerfile  ARG/ENV       → inlined into the bundle\n\nIn both Dockerfiles the ARGs are declared *after* the dependency-install\nstep: BUILD_TIME changes every invocation and would otherwise invalidate\nthat cache layer on every build.\n\n/api/version sits inside the authenticated group. /health stays public for\ncontainer healthchecks; this endpoint names the deployed commit, so there\nis no reason to serve it to anonymous callers.\n\nThe dialog degrades rather than disappears — if the version fetch fails the\nAPI rows read \"unavailable\" and the frontend block still renders. It also\ncloses on Escape, which the existing modals don''t yet do (tracked in\nTODO.md).\n\nAbout.js reads process.env.REACT_APP_* inside getWebBuildInfo() at render\ntime rather than into module-level constants. CRA''s DefinePlugin\nsubstitutes those expressions textually wherever they appear, so the values\nare still compile-time literals, but tests can stub the env without\nre-importing the module — which would hand the component a second React\ninstance and break every hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDcohLpSC7rKWKW3tvQorq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI8I5DRg\ntS+zdfG46ILV8IK3ygLZFUvLTFzkT56OaYVFnPv4N24lZHrsonxFMc1ExCbvIJwM31dHyMpDiY1Y\nVg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-28T00:19:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u