ntent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/dcbcd1b4625e4f1615615f27d7eab99d326bd267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:39:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:39:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: per-entry bucket override\n\nLet an entry''s bucket differ from its category''s default. Adds a nullable\nentries.bucket override (symmetric with the planned transaction override):\nNULL inherits the category''s bucket, a value overrides it — effective\nbucket = COALESCE(entries.bucket, category.bucket).\n\nBackend:\n- Migration 006_add_entry_bucket adds the nullable, CHECK-constrained column.\n- entries.go: Entry.Bucket *string threaded through List/Create/Update;\n  nil/empty stores SQL NULL via a small nullableStr helper.\n\nFrontend:\n- Add/Edit modal gains a Bucket dropdown (\"Inherit from category (…)\" default\n  plus the four buckets); saveEntry sends null when inheriting.\n- Overview \"By Bucket\" card now groups per-entry by effective bucket (so two\n  entries sharing a category but different overrides split correctly); Payments\n  bucket filter uses the effective bucket. entryBucket extracted to utils.js\n  (pure, unit-tested).\n\nDocs: scope doc §3a/§4 document the entry override and renumber the transactions\nmigration to 007; CLAUDE.md updated (Entry model, scope-doc path/v2.1, status).\n\nMigration verified against a real Postgres (nullable + CHECK, up/down); backend\n-race suite and 134 frontend tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CEVhDCXBcM9b3CoXo63qL2","tree":{"sha":"d4d029f39b0b4ac3de048f420647715419fe566a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/d4d029f39b0b4ac3de048f420647715419fe566a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/dcbcd1b4625e4f1615615f27d7eab99d326bd267","verification":{"payload":"tree d4d029f39b0b4ac3de048f420647715419fe566a\nparent e201a490d08dc7a82d0c5dffd929fa7c6516aa04\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784914777 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784914777 +0000\n\nfeat: per-entry bucket override\n\nLet an entry''s bucket differ from its category''s default. Adds a nullable\nentries.bucket override (symmetric with the planned transaction override):\nNULL inherits the category''s bucket, a value overrides it — effective\nbucket = COALESCE(entries.bucket, category.bucket).\n\nBackend:\n- Migration 006_add_entry_bucket adds the nullable, CHECK-constrained column.\n- entries.go: Entry.Bucket *string threaded through List/Create/Update;\n  nil/empty stores SQL NULL via a small nullableStr helper.\n\nFrontend:\n- Add/Edit modal gains a Bucket dropdown (\"Inherit from category (…)\" default\n  plus the four buckets); saveEntry sends null when inheriting.\n- Overview \"By Bucket\" card now groups per-entry by effective bucket (so two\n  entries sharing a category but different overrides split correctly); Payments\n  bucket filter uses the effective bucket. entryBucket extracted to utils.js\n  (pure, unit-tested).\n\nDocs: scope doc §3a/§4 document the entry override and renumber the transactions\nmigration to 007; CLAUDE.md updated (Entry model, scope-doc path/v2.1, status).\n\nMigration verified against a real Postgres (nullable + CHECK, up/down); backend\n-race suite and 134 frontend tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CEVhDCXBcM9b3CoXo63qL2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNoVkuog\nQD6Nk76pFT7jtThHlBWq3jiOuIvi9rL4HPhfuVJkD3EU7rE2U7/mbaqdBMt7fw/M1pKN5Lr6gfLX\nbg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T17:39:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/dcbcd1b4625e4f1615615f27d7eab99d326bd267","node_id":"C_kwDOSkir09oAKGRjYmNkMWI0NjI1ZTRmMTYxNTYxNWYyN2Q3ZWFiOTlkMzI2YmQyNjc","parents