de/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/09a7f77d21ebcbbc306d11fcfcbaec03ff421e98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:04:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:04:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test: mock budgets query in Summary unknown-frequency test; drop CI skip\n\nMerging main revealed the real cause of the earlier CI-only failure: main''s\nSummary handler now also queries `budgets` after `entries`. CI tests the merge\nof branch+base, so its Summary issued the budgets query that the test never\nmocked — go-sqlmock then errored and the handler returned 500. It passed on the\npre-merge branch locally only because that Summary didn''t query budgets yet.\n\nMock the budgets query (empty) like TestSummary_CalculatesCorrectly does, and\nremove the now-unnecessary -race/CI skip and the race_on/off build-tag files.\nThe test runs everywhere again. Verified: backend green under both `go test`\nand `go test -race`; full frontend suite (129 tests) green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Hgomd6CkufcvTHc8sT3Vn","tree":{"sha":"d91e549d4c58cf372c8f0e438243064d9b3941f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/d91e549d4c58cf372c8f0e438243064d9b3941f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/09a7f77d21ebcbbc306d11fcfcbaec03ff421e98","verification":{"payload":"tree d91e549d4c58cf372c8f0e438243064d9b3941f4\nparent 6bbb9a27b3a75f196cc8f5772894ecb38a728151\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782212642 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782212642 +0000\n\ntest: mock budgets query in Summary unknown-frequency test; drop CI skip\n\nMerging main revealed the real cause of the earlier CI-only failure: main''s\nSummary handler now also queries `budgets` after `entries`. CI tests the merge\nof branch+base, so its Summary issued the budgets query that the test never\nmocked — go-sqlmock then errored and the handler returned 500. It passed on the\npre-merge branch locally only because that Summary didn''t query budgets yet.\n\nMock the budgets query (empty) like TestSummary_CalculatesCorrectly does, and\nremove the now-unnecessary -race/CI skip and the race_on/off build-tag files.\nThe test runs everywhere again. Verified: backend green under both `go test`\nand `go test -race`; full frontend suite (129 tests) green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Hgomd6CkufcvTHc8sT3Vn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKs06Jxf\nuClFr3M+5vv91sNjbyGh+xcAWvSpGfJOd/bvMWI9NQ09/9T6OSZWb5Yj6UiU2rTXyWD8nd/C0sx6\nRAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-23T11:04:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","receiv