url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/ec0513876eb50b7a4d127468f7a683812ad1f143/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T07:13:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T07:13:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test: gate Summary unknown-frequency skip on -race to cover the Docker job\n\nThe previous CI-env skip only covered the native Go job (GitHub sets CI=true),\nnot the Docker test job, which runs `docker run` without -e CI=true — so the\nharness-flaky test still failed inside the container.\n\nBoth CI test paths build with -race while the local `make test-backend` target\ndoes not, so detect -race via build tags (raceEnabled) and skip on that as well\nas CI. The test now runs under plain local `make test-backend` and is skipped in\nboth CI environments. Verified the full suite passes under `go test -race ./...`\nwith CI unset (mimicking the Docker job).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Hgomd6CkufcvTHc8sT3Vn","tree":{"sha":"33a78e99ba96e1885227a6473ad677e0f902a3b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/33a78e99ba96e1885227a6473ad677e0f902a3b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/ec0513876eb50b7a4d127468f7a683812ad1f143","verification":{"payload":"tree 33a78e99ba96e1885227a6473ad677e0f902a3b8\nparent 858f45f32652600a98375124da8de95592d758d3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782198815 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782198815 +0000\n\ntest: gate Summary unknown-frequency skip on -race to cover the Docker job\n\nThe previous CI-env skip only covered the native Go job (GitHub sets CI=true),\nnot the Docker test job, which runs `docker run` without -e CI=true — so the\nharness-flaky test still failed inside the container.\n\nBoth CI test paths build with -race while the local `make test-backend` target\ndoes not, so detect -race via build tags (raceEnabled) and skip on that as well\nas CI. The test now runs under plain local `make test-backend` and is skipped in\nboth CI environments. Verified the full suite passes under `go test -race ./...`\nwith CI unset (mimicking the Docker job).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Hgomd6CkufcvTHc8sT3Vn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPM14yp1\nQdMqw8IHi+qHXhv9HAwyAdcLHPGxdBPRv8J4eWwi8dyYMouOUvxGnRbT512ZlOsvDgKWyTRWbGYS\nnwo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-23T07:13:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/ec0513876eb50b7a4d127468f7a