MmI4MTNlZDg4YzJjYzA2NjAyYzVjYjkzNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/21c4f5535c44e52e6b6c1ba5b2fc95748eec1f9c","sha":"21c4f5535c44e52e6b6c1ba5b2fc95748eec1f9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/21c4f5535c44e52e6b6c1ba5b2fc95748eec1f9c"}],"sha":"7851b94885d05d2b813ed88c2cc06602c5cb935f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/7851b94885d05d2b813ed88c2cc06602c5cb935f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/21c4f5535c44e52e6b6c1ba5b2fc95748eec1f9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T10:51:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T10:51:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add variable-expense budgets (monthly allowances per category)\n\nUsers can now set a planned monthly allowance for variable expenses\n(Petrol, Groceries, etc.) that aren''t tracked as fixed recurring entries.\nAllowances are keyed to existing expense categories and folded into the\ndashboard''s monthly-equivalent totals, so the \"leftover each month\"\nfigure reflects planned variable spending.\n\nBackend:\n- New budgets table (migration 004), one allowance per (user, category)\n- BudgetsHandler with user-scoped List/Create/Update/Delete; Create upserts\n  on (user_id, category)\n- Summary endpoint folds budget amounts into monthly expenses and byCategory\n\nFrontend:\n- New Budget tab with a per-category allowance editor and an income /\n  fixed / variable / leftover summary\n- Budgets folded into App''s monthlyExpenses, net, savings rate, and the\n  expense-breakdown pie\n- totalMonthlyBudgets helper in utils.js\n\nTests: Go handler tests, extended Summary test, plus utils/api/Budget\nfrontend tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AYbJGenrhmg7pTYxFTf9NG","tree":{"sha":"7958bca9f704a19de53ee3d30e662d89227fc552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/7958bca9f704a19de53ee3d30e662d89227fc552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/21c4f5535c44e52e6b6c1ba5b2fc95748eec1f9c","verification":{"payload":"tree 7958bca9f704a19de53ee3d30e662d89227fc552\nparent 4f4e47ac9d1ad8a1deb2ec731862cd781d9ec1ba\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781866318 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781866318 +0000\n\nAdd variable-expense budgets (monthly allowances per category)\n\nUsers can now set a planned monthly allowance for variable expenses\n(Petrol, Groceries, etc.) that aren''t tracked as fixed recurring entries.\nAllowances are keyed to existing expense categories and folded into the\ndashboard''s monthly-equivalent totals, so the \"leftover each month\"\nfigure reflects planned variable spending.\n\nBackend:\n- New budgets table (migration 004), one allowance per (user, category)\n- BudgetsHandler with user-scoped List/Create/Update/Delete; Create upserts\n  on (user_id, category)\n- Summary endpoint folds budget amounts into monthly expenses and byCategory\n\nFrontend:\n- New Budget tab with a per-category allowance editor and an income /\n  fixed / variable / leftover summary\n- Budgets folded into App''s monthlyExpenses, net, savings rate, and the\n  expense-breakdown pie\n- totalMonthlyBudgets helper in utils.js\n\nTests: Go handler tests, extended Summary test, plus utils/api/Budget\nfrontend tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AYbJGenrhmg7pTYxFTf9NG\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPTPmbEL\nhJ3Gbyn8mUFL3I8EKrnrZPldNkARoVQQgXS2/9fNwTu8al5LN2RdDLV3NSDFGnW19G8BycjI0l6A\n7QU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-19T10:52:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/21c4f5535c44e52e6b6c1ba5b2fc95748eec1f9c","node_id":"C_kwD