ImportExportHandler with /api/entries/export (streams CSV) and /api/entries/import (multipart CSV upload). Export uses a canonical column order; import validates headers, per-row fields (types, frequency, amount, date), enforces limits (5MB, 1000 rows) and inserts valid rows in a single transaction, returning an ImportResult with counts and per-row errors. Register routes in main.go and protect them with auth.\n\nFrontend: add ImportModal component with client-side CSV preview, template download, drag/drop and file parsing, and import flow. Integrate import/export UI into App.js (toolbar buttons, import modal, export handler and download helper). Extend api.js with exportEntries (downloads CSV blob and filename) and upload/import support. Also adjust frequencies and minor UI refinements.","tree":{"sha":"6088839a66c8a68d8040df8d7e044bfbc2263cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/trees/6088839a66c8a68d8040df8d7e044bfbc2263cd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/git/commits/6f2c44399c0b1b9fff0a9103fc7d3b3f1e447261","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/6f2c44399c0b1b9fff0a9103fc7d3b3f1e447261","node_id":"C_kwDOSkir09oAKDZmMmM0NDM5OWMwYjFiOWZmZjBhOTEwM2ZjN2QzYjNmMWU0NDcyNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commit/a5b4455ccecefe8c542daf8d4eea2b10f3d7ca1e","sha":"a5b4455ccecefe8c542daf8d4eea2b10f3d7ca1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/a5b4455ccecefe8c542daf8d4eea2b10f3d7ca1e"}],"sha":"6f2c44399c0b1b9fff0a9103fc7d3b3f1e447261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vertikar/finance-fullstack/commits/6f2c44399c0b1b9fff0a9103fc7d3b3f1e447261"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/436414?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vertikar/events{/privacy}","foll