ic/cyber-wiki-front/commits/d8402c2c93a72398ba9ef2c2d6c73c722d05e895/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T21:38:32Z","email":"max0xf15@gmail.com","name":"max0xf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T21:38:32Z","email":"max0xf15@gmail.com","name":"max0xf"},"message":"refactor(space-view): fold file overview into the existing tree\n\nReplaces the separate SpaceBrowserView with a single tree that adapts to\nthe available space:\n\n- No file selected: the tree expands to fill the content area\n  (flex-1). Rows render extra columns inline — Comments, Activity (open\n  PRs / local changes / draft edits / commits) and Size. A sticky\n  column-header strip sits above the rows.\n- File selected: the tree collapses back to the narrow w-72 sidebar\n  with compact badges (comment count, PR tag, draft dot) and the\n  FileViewer takes the rest of the width as before.\n\nBoth renderers (`renderWideRow`, `renderNarrowRow`) live in\n`components/space/spaceTreeRowExtras.tsx` and are wired through the\nexisting `FileTree` `renderRowExtras` prop, so the tree component\nitself stays unchanged.\n\nRemoves the unused SpaceBrowserView and its locale block.\n\nSigned-off-by: max0xf <max0xf15@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f77209158b5255a924083bd51c325324f7dde803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/trees/f77209158b5255a924083bd51c325324f7dde803"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/commits/d8402c2c93a72398ba9ef2c2d6c73c722d05e895","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270774903?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/max0xf","id":270774903,"login":"max0xf","node_id":"U_kgDOECOydw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commit/d8402c2c93a72398ba9ef2c2d6c73c722d05e895","node_id":"C_kwDOSksS_9oAKGQ4NDAyYzJjOTNhNzIzOThiYTllZjJjMmQ2YzczYzcyMmQwNWU4OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commit/87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11","sha":"87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commits/87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11"}],"sha":"d8402c2c93a72398ba9ef2c2d6c73c722d05e895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commits/d8402c2c93a72398ba9ef2c2d6c73c722d05e895"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270774903?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/max0xf","id":270774903,"login":"max0xf","node_id":"U_kgDOECOydw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commits/87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T21:28:31Z","email":"max0xf15@gmail.com","name":"max0xf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T21:28:31Z","email":"max0xf15@gmail.com","name":"max0xf"},"message":"feat(space-view): file-list overview + per-row enrichment badges\n\nWhen no document is open, the space view now renders a file-list\noverview instead of the \"Select a document\" placeholder. Mirrors\ndoclab''s FileBrowserView: per-file row with name + icon, comment count,\nopen-PR badge with PR numbers, local-changes / draft-edits / commits\nmarkers, and size. Breadcrumb at the top with an Up button.\n\nSame data also drives per-row badges in the left-sidebar FileTree:\nsmall comment count chip, \"PR\" tag for files touched by open PRs, and\nthe existing yellow draft dot.\n\nPlumbing:\n\n- Backend already exposes /api/enrichments/v1/enrichments/?space_slug=\n  returning {file_path: {pr_diff, comments, edit, local_changes, ...}}.\n- Frontend: new EnrichmentsApiService.getSpaceEnrichments(slug),\n  loadSpaceEnrichments action, wiki/space-enrichments/{load,loaded,\n  error} events, and a matching effect. SpaceViewPage subscribes on\n  space selection and clears state on space switch.\n\nDiagnosis note: the per-file enrichment panel still shows 0 PRs on\nfiles that no open PR touches — that''s correct behavior. Visibility\ninto \"which files in this repo have open PRs at all\" now lives in the\nbrowser view and the tree badges.\n\nSigned-off-by: max0xf <max0xf15@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbff178046554cf08c393e37f0cd3f79c67b9bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/trees/dbff178046554cf08c393e37f0cd3f79c67b9bd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/commits/87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270774903?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/max0xf","id":270774903,"login":"max0xf","node_id":"U_kgDOECOydw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commit/87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11","node_id":"C_kwDOSksS_9oAKDg3NzIxYWZmYmRmYzEyNjYxODllNDU5YzgxMzI0NzgxNGRiMjhkMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commit/f9c53dea849605d721bc2d6f2d41889c5b310293","sha":"f9c53dea849605d721bc2d6f2d41889c5b310293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commits/f9c53dea849605d721bc2d6f2d41889c5b310293"}],"sha":"87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commits/87721affbdfc1266189e459c813247814db28d11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270774903?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/max0xf","id":270774903,"login":"max0xf","node_id":"U_kgDOECOydw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/commits/f9c53dea849605d721bc2d6f2d41889c5b310293/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T20:54:53Z","email":"max0xf15@gmail.com","name":"max0xf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T20:54:53Z","email":"max0xf15@gmail.com","name":"max0xf"},"message":"feat(file-mapping): doclab parity and shared tree component\n\nFile-mapping configuration dialog now matches doclab''s editing surface:\n\n- Left config panel renders the raw repo hierarchy with raw filenames\n  (so users see what they''re configuring) while the right preview\n  renders the mapped/filtered tree.\n- Sticky column header strip (File / Visible / Display As / Status /\n  For Children). Hidden rows (own or inherited) are dimmed.\n- Per-row inheritance status badge: \"<- H1 (parent)\" with path tooltip,\n  \"<- H1 (space)\" for space-default rows, blue \"Override\" for explicit\n  mappings.\n- Per-row \"For Children\" dropdown on folders sets\n  children_display_name_source so a single rule can name every\n  descendant file. Folder rows also support source = Custom with the\n  same inline custom-name input as file rows.\n- Client-side inheritance resolver mirrors the backend walk (explicit\n  -> parent children_source -> space default) so the UI reflects the\n  effective state immediately.\n- Scroll positions on both panes are preserved across mapping\n  mutations (snapshot before reload, restore on tree state commit).\n- Preview pane gains a \"Name\" sticky column header so both panes line\n  up vertically.\n\nSpace view + tree component:\n\n- Space view (SpaceViewPage) now passes space.filters to loadFileTree\n  so filter config configured in the dialog actually applies to the\n  sidebar tree.\n- Replaced the bespoke TreeNodeItem in SpaceViewPage with the shared\n  FileTree component. Draft markers (yellow dot) are rendered via the\n  existing renderRowExtras prop. FileTree gained controlled\n  `expandedPaths` and a `getRowClassName` hook to support both call\n  sites.\n\nLazy-load bug fix:\n\n- Subfolder expansion used to hit /api/git-provider/v1/tree?path=...\n  which enforces strict service-token matching (provider_type + exact\n  base_url) and 400s for valid requests when the stored token''s\n  base_url drifts. Lazy-load now goes through the wiki endpoint\n  (which has the same fallback the root load uses), so expand works\n  consistently in both the config panel and the space-view sidebar.\n- Removed the now-dead wiki/git-tree/load event, loadGitSubtree\n  action, and the corresponding effect.\n\nType-check + lint pass clean.\n\nSigned-off-by: max0xf <max0xf15@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"01253a3c2ce3fc214db861d51dd67fa7be799199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/trees/01253a3c2ce3fc214db861d51dd67fa7be799199"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/commits/f9c53dea849605d721bc2d6f2d41889c5b310293","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270774903?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max0xf/followers","f