unmapped HTTP status codes\n- LogsPage: treat zero-byte dataSize as valid (null check, not falsy)\n- BlameView: normalize CRLF and strip trailing empty line\n- wikiEffects: emit spaces/loaded with empty payload on load failure\n- SpaceViewPage: clear stale selectedLines on hash change\n- useDebugMode: deduplicate loadUserSettings across consumers\n\nType safety:\n- GitOpsLogEntry.status: replace loose string with GitOpsLogStatus enum\n- ApiTokensSection: validate expires_in_days as positive integer\n- profileEffects: route cache errors to profile/cache/error channel\n\nAccessibility:\n- SpacesPage: aria-label on favorite toggle buttons\n- PRsPage: aria-label on search input and filter selects\n- SpaceConfigurationPage: aria-label on icon-only action buttons\n- FileMappingPreview: aria-label on view toggle buttons\n\nUX:\n- SpaceConfigurationPage: replace window.confirm with ConfirmDialog\n- App.tsx: guard LogsPage route by debugMode flag\n- SpaceConfigurationPage: normalize Windows backslash paths in display\n\nMinor:\n- notify.success: add missing devLog call","tree":{"sha":"2769a7e159fe29dd0b39f5233e94f3ddca803ab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/trees/2769a7e159fe29dd0b39f5233e94f3ddca803ab0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/commits/3ad856e03608760f4cb1a4e421d885196375e475","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4174322?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mitriyweb","id":4174322,"login":"Mitriyweb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzQzMjI=","organizations_url