ed SourceView\n  for non-markdown files)\n- Add CodeEditor — editable Monaco for non-markdown edit mode (replaces\n  bare textarea with syntax highlighting, line numbers, folding)\n- Add useMonacoTheme hook — syncs Monaco theme with app data-theme attr\n- Add monacoSetup — idempotent TOML monarch grammar registration\n- Update FileRenderer to lazy-load CodeViewer for non-markdown files\n- Update FileViewer to lazy-load CodeEditor for non-markdown edit mode\n- Isolate monaco-editor into vendor-monaco chunk in vite.config.ts\n- Exclude monaco-editor from Vite optimizeDeps pre-bundling\n- Add monaco-editor 0.55.1 and @monaco-editor/react 4.7.0 dependencies\n- Pin milkdown deps (remove caret prefixes)","tree":{"sha":"84fdd9d8b52df95240ee19bee398b4fda0c5cfdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/trees/84fdd9d8b52df95240ee19bee398b4fda0c5cfdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/cyber-wiki-front/git/commits/f08d2afcf26892a0754c6b3c37f848ab68e9c53f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4174322?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mitriyweb","id":4174322,"login":"Mitriyweb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzQzMjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mitriyweb/subscriptions","type":"User