n Node 24.14.x\n- new nightly/manual CLI e2e workflow with broader scenario coverage\n\nAdd reusable CLI e2e runners:\n- shared harness with step logs and JSON summaries\n- PR smoke scenario covering create, install, build, type-check,\n  validate, scaffold layout, and ai sync\n- nightly scenario covering custom UIKit, layer scaffolds, migrate,\n  invalid-name rejection, and ai sync idempotency\n\nHarden generated project templates to make the scaffold path verifiable:\n- initialize git before install in e2e flow to satisfy postinstall\n- fix generated MFE manifest typing for empty registries\n- fix bootstrap type issues so fresh projects pass type-check\n\nDocument local CLI verification and required branch-protection checks\nin CONTRIBUTING.md.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"8584b9767617e2e1be92ba5e9f4de515931937c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx/git/trees/8584b9767617e2e1be92ba5e9f4de515931937c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx/git/commits/04505645c549a3229763881b9baee67bbc8b0f76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti