e067b0ccb7697"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changquan/multi-agent-orchestration/commits/9898f1b32aa69679f6af7590492e13659118b096/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T15:20:17Z","email":"dev@changquan.com","name":"Changquan Yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T15:20:17Z","email":"dev@changquan.com","name":"Changquan Yu"},"message":"refactor: modularize agent architecture from monolithic to domain-based structure\n\n- Extract SmartAgent base class to src/agents/base.py\n- Organize agents into domain packages:\n  * managers/: PM_Agent, Architect_Agent\n  * developers/: Frontend_Agent, Backend_Agent\n  * quality/: QA_Agent\n  * infrastructure/: DevOps_Agent\n  * utils/: Shared utilities (placeholder)\n\nBenefits:\n- Reduced monolithic file from 890 to ~100-150 lines per module\n- Clear separation of concerns by domain and responsibility\n- Improved scalability for adding new agents\n- Better maintainability and IDE support\n- Zero breaking changes to public API\n- Test coverage improved to 83% (119/119 tests passing)\n\nStructure:\n- 13 focused Python modules instead of 1 monolithic file\n- Hierarchical package organization for future expansion\n- Backward-compatible imports from src.agents\n- Domain-specific imports: managers, developers, quality, infrastructure","tree":{"sha":"085e16dbe3928ab363fc19212361b070065b559f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changquan/multi-agent-orchestration/git/trees/085e16dbe3928ab363fc19212361b070065b559f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changquan/multi-agent-orchestration/git/commits/9898f1b32aa69679f6af7590492e13659118b096","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/changquan/multi-agent-orchestration/commit/9898f1b32aa69679f6af7590492e13659118b096","node_id":"C_kwDOSk2DsNoAKDk4OThmMWIzMmFhNjk2NzlmNmFmNzU5MDQ5MmUxMzY1OTExOGIwOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"http