.noreply.github.com","name":"Anton Bakulev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T22:13:24Z","email":"4963111+bakulev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anton Bakulev"},"message":"fix(flutter-embed): stabilize bridge controls and presentation UI\n\nPrevent Dart bridge command fallthrough so sync_state no longer resets the embedded Flutter widget state.\n\nSend the computed React host state to Flutter immediately when controller inputs change, and make the top-level Reboot Flutter button invoke the real Dart reboot/sync flow.\n\nEnable Flutter semantics so embedded controls are visible to browser/manual interaction tools, which also makes the bidirectional bridge easier to verify.\n\nNormalize invalid Tailwind slate shade classes that rendered as bright/default borders, and replace the ad-hoc slide text parser with markdown rendering for headings, ordered lists, bold text, and inline code.\n\nRebuild the committed Flutter Web bundle in public/flutter_embed/main.dart.js.\n\nTests: flutter analyze; flutter test; npm run lint; npm run build","tree":{"sha":"c12a7d275d876a1fc19c208b5926080490e63985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bakulev/react-flutter-emded-showcase/git/trees/c12a7d275d876a1fc19c208b5926080490e63985"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bakulev/react-flutter-emded-showcase/git/commits/6ab1eb2400ccb26b7776eb816c55d5dda0bc9120","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4963111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bakulev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bakulev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bakulev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bakulev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bakulev","id":4963111,"login":"bakulev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.githu