vite build. The webapp is clean today, so this changes no output — it\nkeeps the next error from accumulating unseen.","tree":{"sha":"85a137e388c5ae9647e1b6e8c666fd4bb3d5afdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/85a137e388c5ae9647e1b6e8c666fd4bb3d5afdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/d269b8aeed4be7bde22c8b67ea11d2dc67b2d8ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 85a137e388c5ae9647e1b6e8c666fd4bb3d5afdf\nparent 19a9203199263a83f057a174b22beb51f5ab9eb0\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1790018300 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790018300 +1200\n\nbuild: typecheck the webapp (#63)\n\ntsconfig.webapp.json has been in the repository without anything running\nit: the root tsc build covers the plugin, and vite transpiles the webapp\nwithout checking types, so the webapp was typechecked by nothing.\n\n`npm run typecheck:webapp` runs it, between the plugin build and the\nvite build. The webapp is clean today, so this changes no output — it\nkeeps the next error from accumulating unseen.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsYL8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlR0QAFm+0pdFciqJWFsBjfh/80QV\n7lyTH1tSMusV2U09jFUcIqY2DQt5HR7hh+m8PPF4BSzcRQsMEfp5gyHYBZOkuJoz\nxyCdMERtpYK5aEK6ihniNllYsyyO9S7Yexk3iZ3cmhKUWMp9BRVj6deDLGLZpz5x\neG+Pon+lcKrc7QUeBgSHMH1htlUN6ORn80s4jJ8U4sDS+sGN8660/uU/jkHZ4nLD\nuwSCAHS2oCn/qESQTmkPpgnMhgfKwl/sTN9DvB2JBOg9tWXPECNmH0e9g9wogqON\nEa98oN+g19P4sBCP/QbLvHfdYtLu0M0m+poQaXpavdkbOLGvdkwhc3jKVdU8Dk73\nNJlJzI8vR53DH7zJUZ95nyOH03pL4GhTgxPy24aeo8ESO6T+FaUiZ8p2S+5bf5CK\nqrLw3sCEB2m+o+9DAKvKRFiixIH1YWkOGo1AQ3Vh0VAJPNLiMSk0igwEoCEJUZPQ\n4OesLfxGzJpQiGSMAF9e+tiUYM81LCEOcS7rc39o96E1LWFZSUf3TxF5dXAQ8Ki1\nNMFxaMqM/LpTuUOVxzmcPnsghlN4SMwLHMtZdZTi3siHg31JuvgT7nYkcZUYEvoW\nAKAWx/VDkrkOrQAefwNoyq0+nz4TSyHJLrZMJS3GEa5pQQGDqKuTSbXtLhNNlnPe\nnCFi3mT8+iomwUPRBaRf\n=YJjl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T19:1