":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/19a9203199263a83f057a174b22beb51f5ab9eb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:30:18Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:30:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: keep every release-please run in one concurrency group (#62)\n\nThe group was keyed on github.ref. The action is given no target-branch,\nso every run acts on the default branch''s release pull request — a\ndispatch launched from another branch would land in a group of its own\nand edit that pull request alongside a master run, which is the\ncollision the group exists to prevent. A constant group matches what the\nruns actually contend for.","tree":{"sha":"cb16a8b0fdd1594fdbe4cf414459a01a85c5a606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/cb16a8b0fdd1594fdbe4cf414459a01a85c5a606"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/19a9203199263a83f057a174b22beb51f5ab9eb0","verification":{"payload":"tree cb16a8b0fdd1594fdbe4cf414459a01a85c5a606\nparent f11cdcf4ef12c78cc5d0c740c7edd3442782fe65\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1790015418 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790015418 +1200\n\nci: keep every release-please run in one concurrency group (#62)\n\nThe group was keyed on github.ref. The action is given no target-branch,\nso every run acts on the default branch''s release pull request — a\ndispatch launched from another branch would land in a group of its own\nand edit that pull request alongside a master run, which is the\ncollision the group exists to prevent. A constant group matches what the\nruns actually contend for.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsXe6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATLcQAEMH97+F6cCWzzWTjPd1blE/\nUvuRHtWrSNQ/q/cuyUArJYbWlxRyjvIA5o81SDsKjJKLyWKi9LtTplmrhUoqFwfX\nxZOrj7YpkGVhkyRnCPdbZ3JbV2cb6pUZEN2UnPLzuPPVcsS6fWrP7YwsZc4C2tFg\nkDixHU/AaRw1NkqbXtsC4bcYMyr1354Bm6HGtfhrf3zAOg7CY3mtBho4frKQJFup\nFK/htUNBeEuq7SqSNuwkKfXGXaL1AdfoKeru3a/hqhnG/L9i+vkwq+jsUp7rmOxV\nMgcOceOrxSUWzjMc/0IpKAla0KBTu2S9NV/pYmkAmJaxSt6Urc1dDxLDnYLL//dV\nztnLY+j1FZCE2zx0IJEDaqPPB/vxR3r2PSedO1C5VvcMVsR6O7jWnonOxUQHA3qy\nhMChwyZE7UDPetTeGVIWvEc+x7vKBAFUTUNaJl1iI68YInDM+UH43t3ZIVAb3FzL\nEvsZFpZQN/aiLYxussz/8tHo3iXqm0BP08qexCSQRFQMPU0MzkSn98GgOXkOeiQT\nrmmIoM5+9otNlZO/KHrTUydAuVUPDPQg1Vf1nb/CuWUM5JpgKl/1z8DIrcMF8XSK\ndNRb3hzuFpKWQi0/YX2Piivi4OAdV8ZWPI0HBeKFkywEte4pNeBO0g9UNur8gGEZ\nUUos/Kg6RZpsezRtnyo2\n=LTOj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T18:30:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip