email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: let release-please be run manually (#61)\n\nThe gate runs release-please only for a push carrying a commit users\nget, so a release pull request it has already opened is not refreshed by\na docs or ci merge — and a change to release-please''s own configuration\nis exactly such a merge, leaving an outstanding release pull request\ncomputing its version under configuration that is no longer there.\n\nworkflow_dispatch re-runs it on demand. A manual run carries no commits\nto judge and asking for one is the statement that it should happen, so\nit bypasses the gate rather than being skipped for an empty payload.\n\nTwo runs can now overlap — a manual one alongside a push — so a\nconcurrency group keeps them off each other. cancel-in-progress is\nfalse, so a run already creating a tag or dispatching the publish is\nnever killed part-way.","tree":{"sha":"6cfd1e6392a7aa416eee5cde4e7fab8b0aa6fd69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/6cfd1e6392a7aa416eee5cde4e7fab8b0aa6fd69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/f11cdcf4ef12c78cc5d0c740c7edd3442782fe65","verification":{"payload":"tree 6cfd1e6392a7aa416eee5cde4e7fab8b0aa6fd69\nparent d8dd1c1e01bfd4211de576900b47d0fea4a3923a\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789966288 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789966288 +1200\n\nci: let release-please be run manually (#61)\n\nThe gate runs release-please only for a push carrying a commit users\nget, so a release pull request it has already opened is not refreshed by\na docs or ci merge — and a change to release-please''s own configuration\nis exactly such a merge, leaving an outstanding release pull request\ncomputing its version under configuration that is no longer there.\n\nworkflow_dispatch re-runs it on demand. A manual run carries no commits\nto judge and asking for one is the statement that it should happen, so\nit bypasses the gate rather than being skipped for an empty payload.\n\nTwo runs can now overlap — a manual one alongside a push — so a\nconcurrency group keeps them off each other. cancel-in-progress is\nfalse, so a run already creating a tag or dispatching the publish is\nnever killed part-way.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsLfQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+0kQABvSoQkBmc4oLN1h85ZIZIUO\n3aNpOekV0/DtAoRGD1LIPv/XYMBmFZCClE96Y+2xjLYC/cPQYxP1ZyxgeqLXJZRC\nZ0NmzjLbDMregmddzVkkTT6bhNGSEUNMsjWF6sIIR7cBeIfl8SIgvHGCbR54QQoC\nVwPf5sRdqINgsMTAPl3DQyrH+D4uZB8p8xgC/DJTob6vJYkU4mibFL0O+63AvOg2\nO5FOsqzdeYrtofkH5C7hlxD4Wkyhosv0DQPBOFZOE6l8J2VLDgS4k/kjWNTg/Ihl\nGg1A7CesOK40ScAonesfAbH+Zx3WNjqCHoUjgLgjWc2PLhN8Sxffxq/40v3DDAvl\nhqdtG/q0UXVlDGXC2p1keM0Reu2uJIdd976o/vT1TMpYfMQ3ilyGykP6jQFGYflU\nbHUglKvLsEl5l6F3UTIMr2JcwQ8mtm6JRF1SeBY6OGX2SDy1evYZjCmJmQy/aEDH\nuozqnRqilsYdmgkmwxrEXj5oTYcOCXXFryQzOA7Ea8CdNQgSCnGevMNzY9zOjA7S\nkXHCwTmLvymoGfa+12/jSNIhhdQkw+jTcc6YWQmhFPaa0Ca7CH6KbwPfDfA85h2S\nrW6tDisRWmcU8myHZP214jtKB2dRY8/CPW3AexW19gx0tc3t42crZWKtCLKg97UC\ngcXtwJ+ClSm/E5bGIKdB\n=xt5J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T04:51:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptio