il":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: derive the release bump from the commit type (#60)\n\nalways-bump-patch made every release a PATCH regardless of what it\ncontained, so a feature shipped under a version that said nothing had\nbeen added. Removing the key restores release-please''s default: feat is\na minor, fix and perf a patch, and a `!` or BREAKING CHANGE footer a\nmajor.\n\nA Release-As footer still pins a specific version when the derived one\nis not what a release should carry.","tree":{"sha":"ce2bed083b1f6c029d21151cf1b6d93d33451624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/ce2bed083b1f6c029d21151cf1b6d93d33451624"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/d8dd1c1e01bfd4211de576900b47d0fea4a3923a","verification":{"payload":"tree ce2bed083b1f6c029d21151cf1b6d93d33451624\nparent 325271effb39d07c513e1e940a2ead8f896b8814\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789958098 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789958098 +1200\n\nci: derive the release bump from the commit type (#60)\n\nalways-bump-patch made every release a PATCH regardless of what it\ncontained, so a feature shipped under a version that said nothing had\nbeen added. Removing the key restores release-please''s default: feat is\na minor, fix and perf a patch, and a `!` or BREAKING CHANGE footer a\nmajor.\n\nA Release-As footer still pins a specific version when the derived one\nis not what a release should carry.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsJfSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuBMQAF4x1vPF9VfbaL8mkucks+ay\nfBhhwWkHhsIIH9FIyNoOWEV3txLIZIMbo63kVRnmxlatzUv84ywANNuXXOOiI+gB\ni+sFsz57QG6e0/mJQMgdQtrqGBk+/5AwriHRRKINaknOaP5kIFlMWHjANveuI2Or\nwejxnvdhHAniVjohysA1d0u4wbrrorVl8dk8HTuh2tqaqlNS9bDwik+apbBj+HMY\ndvPs77GQIIiXIfyoET0yn1L/hQEpcnC2w/JlheqjUTrUdO/qbrEdPPZ20PIepbmL\nbDBFRbtqXw/nrgO00FcqjjaljYHtdFeqJYLibNigHf9P9a9tZp4qlbNuRM4jGJCf\nbVEa9Yl0wzUX3TlD0+vefIEfY