ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/4e8d1058b60c45f46492b02485409b77cb1f421b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T21:42:43Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T21:42:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: adopt release-please with label-driven notes (#58)\n\nPorts the signalk-questdb release setup, as merged in signalk-updater\n#71. Merging to master opens a \"chore: release X.Y.Z\" PR; merging that\ncreates the tag and the GitHub release, then dispatches publish.yml on\nthe tag to publish to npm.\n\nversioning is always-bump-patch, so every release is a PATCH bump\nregardless of commit type; anything else goes through a Release-As\nfooter. changelog-type is github, which is what produces the\n\"by @author\" lines — include-commit-authors is a no-op upstream. No\nCHANGELOG.md is kept (skip-changelog): prettier fails on the generated\none and CI does not run on the release PR to show it.\n\nA gate job fronts release-please. GitHub''s generated notes are never\nempty, so release-please''s \"no user-facing commits\" skip never fires and\na lone docs or ci merge would otherwise propose a release. The gate lets\na push through only when it carries a commit users get.\n\nlabel-by-title.yml labels each PR from its conventional-commit type and\nrelease.yml sorts the notes by those labels. dependabot now emits\nbuild(deps) for runtime bumps and ci(deps) for actions, which is the\ndistinction the gate reads.\n\npublish.yml gains workflow_dispatch: a tag pushed with GITHUB_TOKEN\nstarts no workflow, and npm trusted publishing is bound to this\nfilename, so release-please dispatches this file rather than publishing\nfrom its own. Its release job is now prerelease-only, since\nrelease-please creates the GitHub release for real versions, and publish\nno longer needs that job so a real release still publishes when it is\nskipped.\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md gains the repository link and the license-grant heading\nthe other plugins carry, and its local chain now names format and\nci-lint rather than build:all alone, which never checked formatting.","tree":{"sha":"d11425b553996b1159476dfb789d52bfbb67ec2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/d11425b553996b1159476dfb789d52bfbb67ec2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/4e8d1058b60c45f46492b02485409b77cb1f421b","verification":{"payload":"tree d11425b553996b1159476dfb789d52bfbb67ec2a\nparent 0f7c3e96a3e2fcc1ae87cea37912032e455856d3\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789940563 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789940563 +1200\n\nci: adopt release-please with label-driven notes (#58)\n\nPorts the signalk-questdb release setup, as merged in signalk-updater\n#71. Merging to master opens a \"chore: release X.Y.Z\" PR; merging that\ncreates the tag and the GitHub release, then dispatches publish.yml on\nthe tag to publish to npm.\n\nversioning is always-bump-patch, so every release is a PATCH bump\nregardless of commit type; anything else goes through a Release-As\nfooter. changelog-type is github, which is what produces the\n\"by @author\" lines — include-commit-authors is a no-op upstream. No\nCHANGELOG.md is kept (skip-changelog): prettier fails on the generated\none and CI does not run on the release PR to show it.\n\nA gate job fronts release-please. GitHub''s generated notes are never\nempty, so release-please''s \"no user-facing commits\" skip never fires and\na lone docs or ci merge would otherwise propose a release. The gate lets\na push through only when it carries a commit users get.\n\nlabel-by-title.yml labels each PR from its conventional-commit type and\nrelease.yml sorts the notes by those labels. dependabot now emits\nbuild(deps) for runtime bumps and ci(deps) for actions, which is the\ndistinction the gate reads.\n\npublish.yml gains workflow_dispatch: a tag pushed with GITHUB_TOKEN\nstarts no workflow, and npm trusted publishing is bound to this\nfilename, so release-please dispatches this file rather than publishing\nfrom its own. Its release job is now prerelease-only, since\nrelease-please creates the GitHub release for real versions, and publish\nno longer needs that job so a real release still publishes when it is\nskipped.\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md gains the repository link and the license-grant heading\nthe other plugins carry, and its local chain now names format and\nci-lint rather than build:all alone, which never checked formatting.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsFNTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdCAQAIenlGLpLrH6HxUoe+Laru0P\n8CwstgQAXdgfewmvH64K2C8/DyvkYBP4uAVm9vIevLSKAsTS6n/+pY06p1o6JAS8\nGRNGWlNdEI8pQeI6PEZ44kynw/VEtG51BJ4OChTpGJiztCCWjLUBpNwmk8+eXTYO\nO6BZuFRYabZIramj1Xe7DgdmvAxXCmdilHzh8/9fjBsJZTwamIRVcS6Ra1OsoVpv\nz+EDFq6fb/CwbP4oeBt3SPsc7ucP9O3+O95zep5InYv38MUqx4P6pO7LBhOWr6cn\n3IqYiYYdCkMcdzyWvVlRmkhlJmTouTtrEDQcBAR88+8uRETJJ3lBwuspuPQsNf6q\nDW6Gmte4XHQlPuN9AwG4T7u7OAYAaj6r9QKa4+BGgIrSmKupBR3Q8/wksREQPh8v\nsYEeAUIeaJ4WyJcMRxCF5Fn4OEPGBh5JBphyCS5CEOv4wLS3qpksaUTIgiwZtbrY\n1QHR811/