ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/1a2bdc2e46e86037b60b6f26d639e6488e665f15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T02:04:11Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T02:04:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: state installer-only scope and fix drift (#39)\n\n* docs: state installer-only scope and fix drift\n\nAdd a prominent notice that this plugin is only meant to run as part of\nthe signalk-universal-installer stack — it''s a thin shell with no value\nstandalone. Correct documentation that drifted from the code: bump the\nstatus to 0.3.0, replace the old \"serves a webapp and redirects to the\nconsole\" description with the current embedded Module Federation panel +\nsame-origin /console reverse proxy, drop the removed imageTag config\noption, and fix the admin embed route to /admin/#/e/signalk_doctor.\n\n* docs: drop hardcoded version, fix route comments\n\nRemove the hardcoded version line from the README — version lives in\npackage.json/releases, not docs, to avoid drift. Correct the stale\n/admin/#/e/Doctor route comments in vite.config.ts and AppPanel.tsx to\nthe actual /admin/#/e/signalk_doctor (the admin derives the route from\nthe package name; \"Doctor\" was the displayName, not the route segment).","tree":{"sha":"05775896d50e2c93ce1b432bf2917ed3eaa99910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/05775896d50e2c93ce1b432bf2917ed3eaa99910"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/1a2bdc2e46e86037b60b6f26d639e6488e665f15","verification":{"payload":"tree 05775896d50e2c93ce1b432bf2917ed3eaa99910\nparent e5f9bfc6bbaf042a0d96b8a40a3ee84e4d617ff5\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1779933851 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779933851 +1200\n\ndocs: state installer-only scope and fix drift (#39)\n\n* docs: state installer-only scope and fix drift\n\nAdd a prominent notice that this plugin is only meant to run as part of\nthe signalk-universal-installer stack — it''s a thin shell with no value\nstandalone. Correct documentation that drifted from the code: bump the\nstatus to 0.3.0, replace the old \"serves a webapp and redirects to the\nconsole\" description with the current embedded Module Federation panel +\nsame-origin /console reverse proxy, drop the removed imageTag config\noption, and fix the admin embed route to /admin/#/e/signalk_doctor.\n\n* docs: drop hardcoded version, fix route comments\n\nRemove the hardcoded version line from the README — version lives in\npackage.json/releases, not docs, to avoid drift. Correct the stale\n/admin/#/e/Doctor route comments in vite.config.ts and AppPanel.tsx to\nthe actual /admin/#/e/signalk_doctor (the admin derives the route from\nthe package name; \"Doctor\" was the displayName, not the route segment).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqF6KbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcb8QACjaDAOo0daHjbGceRE2keZu\ni5OWP0WjsPYqTaw4U3PvAzCKlZhG3cPjCPQU+My0sreUKFlqfMLtCJq/Jio/IYex\nYFoT1BzShuOXLOR6tMGkW//9ARoStB92FTEUaDN1b6S9xi7OcygpHgSeoyxpfMMn\nBq