/645a64ba248a732eadc705390112974cb387c3c4","node_id":"C_kwDOSlNf4NoAKDY0NWE2NGJhMjQ4YTczMmVhZGM3MDUzOTAxMTI5NzRjYjM4N2MzYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commit/a366972e9aef5ebd5cec0a48eee219fdc3ae7b89","sha":"a366972e9aef5ebd5cec0a48eee219fdc3ae7b89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/a366972e9aef5ebd5cec0a48eee219fdc3ae7b89"}],"sha":"645a64ba248a732eadc705390112974cb387c3c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/645a64ba248a732eadc705390112974cb387c3c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/a366972e9aef5ebd5cec0a48eee219fdc3ae7b89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T00:03:49Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T00:03:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(webapp): embed doctor console in admin sidebar via iframe panel (#36)\n\nSwitch from a standalone redirect-shell webapp (signalk-webapp keyword,\nwindow.location.replace to engine console) to a Module Federation\nembeddable panel (signalk-embeddable-webapp keyword, React component\nexposed as ./AppPanel). The admin UI now hosts the Doctor inside its\nown shell at /admin/#/e/Doctor with the sidebar still visible.\n\nThe panel renders one full-height iframe pointing at a same-origin\nreverse proxy mounted at /plugins/signalk-doctor/console/ that\nforwards to the engine container. Same-origin keeps cookies, SSE\nstreams, and HTTPS reverse-proxy setups (Traefik/nginx) working\nwithout mixed-content or CORS workarounds.\n\nThe proxy is SSE-aware (no response buffering on non-HTML responses)\nand injects <meta name=\"api-base\" content=\"...\"> into HTML responses\nso the engine UI can prefix its API calls. text/event-stream responses\nalso get Cache-Control: no-transform appended to defeat signalk-server''s\ncompression() middleware which would otherwise buffer SSE for minutes.\n\nRequires signalk-doctor-server >= 0.7.8 (shipped 2026-05-27) for the\nengine-side api-base meta tag support + Vite base: ''./''.\n\nModule Federation config bakes in the React-sharing fixes proven by\nsignalk-updater 0.3.x:\n  - react/react-dom: import: false (singleton, host-provided)\n  - react/jsx-runtime + jsx-dev-runtime: import: true (bundled\n    self-contained, since the admin only pre-registers react/react-dom)\n\nBuild uses Vite + @vitejs/plugin-react + @module-federation/vite.\nReact 19 shared with the admin shell.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"10ec614e657963eb5ddcf7db435f76368408a256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/10ec614e657963eb5ddcf7db435f76368408a256"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/a366972e9aef5ebd5cec0a48eee219fdc3ae7b89","verification":{"payload":"tree 10ec614e657963eb5ddcf7db435f76368408a256\nparent b0acd6e1f8d7a2414a1547f6851e00f96218bef1\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1779840229 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779840229 +1200\n\nfeat(webapp): embed doctor console in admin sidebar via iframe panel (#36)\n\nSwitch from a standalone redirect-shell webapp (signalk-webapp keyword,\nwindow.location.replace to engine console) to a Module Federation\nembeddable panel (signalk-embeddable-webapp keyword, React component\nexposed as ./AppPanel). The admin UI now hosts the Doctor inside its\nown shell at /admin/#/e/Doctor with the sidebar still visible.\n\nThe panel renders one full-height iframe pointing at a same-origin\nreverse proxy mounted at /plugins/signalk-doctor/console/ that\nforwards to the engine container. Same-origin keeps cookies, SSE\nstreams, and HTTPS reverse-proxy setups (Traefik/nginx) working\nwithout mixed-content or CORS workarounds.\n\nThe proxy is SSE-aware (no response buffering on non-HTML responses)\nand injects <meta name=\"api-base\" content=\"...\"> into HTML responses\nso the engine UI can prefix its API calls. text/event-stream responses\nalso get Cache-Control: no-transform appended to defeat signalk-server''s\ncompression() middleware which would otherwise buffer SSE for minutes.\n\nRequires signalk-doctor-server >= 0.7.8 (shipped 2026-05-27) for the\nengine-side api-base meta tag support + Vite base: ''./''.\n\nModule Federation config bakes in the React-sharing fixes proven by\nsignalk-updater 0.3.x:\n  - react/react-dom: import: false (singleton, host-provided)\n  - react/jsx-runtime + jsx-dev-runtime: import: true (bundled\n    self-contained, since the admin only pre-registers react/react-dom)\n\nBuild uses Vite + @vitejs/plugin-react + @module-federation/vite.\nReact 19 shared with the admin shell.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFjTlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL34QADfYMEdi6QoIXYkruoDXzybM\nj98L7ZUlDAh87sovbFO/+FhX/Out835Ciut9XUTrJFkRMtso6Tk06oa2C35yqb4T\nKA1ye0urES9SGMmIrrPw/5j0YaeL3qsmqLcBSqeAg3r1wAeZYoA