ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commit/b0acd6e1f8d7a2414a1547f6851e00f96218bef1","node_id":"C_kwDOSlNf4NoAKGIwYWNkNmUxZjhkN2EyNDE0YTE1NDdmNjg1MWUwMGY5NjIxOGJlZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commit/e72539d34350df91853fde794a7c254e91bce1b5","sha":"e72539d34350df91853fde794a7c254e91bce1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/e72539d34350df91853fde794a7c254e91bce1b5"}],"sha":"b0acd6e1f8d7a2414a1547f6851e00f96218bef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/b0acd6e1f8d7a2414a1547f6851e00f96218bef1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/commits/e72539d34350df91853fde794a7c254e91bce1b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T19:25:58Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T19:25:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: drop DOCTOR_SERVER_VERSION; ask engine for its version (#34)\n\nThe hand-bumped DOCTOR_SERVER_VERSION constant + resolveImageTag\nhelper + `imageTag: \"auto\"` schema option were the wrong layer to\ntrack the engine''s running version. The engine container''s Quadlet\npins :latest by default (per the installer''s OperatorIntent /\nRuntimeIdentity model), so the plugin shouldn''t be mirroring a\nspecific semver at all — it should ask the engine.\n\nMirrors the cleanup done in signalk-updater #41.\n\n- `currentTag` in updates.register() is now the literal \"latest\"\n  (the channel the Quadlet tracks).\n- New `currentVersion` async callback HTTP-fetches /api/health.version\n  on the engine (port 3004). signalk-container''s update comparator\n  prefers this over currentTag.\n- Deleted src/config/image-tag.ts.\n- Removed `imageTag` schema field (nothing to configure now).\n- /api/info now exposes `currentTag: \"latest\"` for symmetry with the\n  updater plugin''s /api/info shape.\n- AGENTS.md \"Gotchas\": replaced the \"Plugin version and doctor-server\n  image version are decoupled\" rule with \"Ask the engine; don''t mirror\n  it\" that captures the new model and the history of why the prior\n  approach failed.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6901e436d541bf3b8001a05c957ff22c1cd776d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/e6901e436d541bf3b8001a05c957ff22c1cd776d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/e72539d34350df91853fde794a7c254e91bce1b5","verification":{"payload":"tree e6901e436d541bf3b8001a05c957ff22c1cd776d\nparent 4496ace1e0456146cb50cb5a1744408c41e36bb7\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1779737158 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779737158 +1200\n\nrefactor: drop DOCTOR_SERVER_VERSION; ask engine for its version (#34)\n\nThe hand-bumped DOCTOR_SERVER_VERSION constant + resolveImageTag\nhelper + `imageTag: \"auto\"` schema option were the wrong layer to\ntrack the engine''s running version. The engine container''s Quadlet\npins :latest by default (per the installer''s OperatorIntent /\nRuntimeIdentity model), so the plugin shouldn''t be mirroring a\nspecific semver at all — it should ask the engine.\n\nMirrors the cleanup done in signalk-updater #41.\n\n- `currentTag` in updates.register() is now the literal \"latest\"\n  (the channel the Quadlet tracks).\n- New `currentVersion` async callback HTTP-fetches /api/health.version\n  on the engine (port 3004). signalk-container''s update comparator\n  prefers this over currentTag.\n- Deleted src/config/image-tag.ts.\n- Removed `imageTag` schema field (nothing to configure now).\n- /api/info now exposes `currentTag: \"latest\"` for symmetry with the\n  updater plugin''s /api/info shape.\n- AGENTS.md \"Gotchas\": replaced the \"Plugin version and doctor-server\n  image version are decoupled\" rule with \"Ask the engine; don''t mirror\n  it\" that captures the new model and the history of why the prior\n  approach failed.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFKJGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtJkQAKwPEsCHemZANDgz7wobBXt2\ns074GJSxLx7mkAm1xqyGcpQ9Q5B6d4rwCToBA9WPDPhkRZVWEU1jfrH+jeE7HESm\nOaa1K6yhI46YRf6o3fFq6A3ao3x67H5FHYv4I6GeuHDKpOn1Hs4icFZuXSZxP9Qn\n1abGj1ShUp8ac8tXMiJ9mia5mn0+ae+Szs1/o8wX73MIt2qQl86ZAyqRDrauU+OK\nmdRN3amfP7xkjXaljDC/uJpPWigZP4MvYz67BVvzWyr+szQrdfRzl/vlfDoIDmUA\nX1iGeJ4gbl1mVmIVa8/UAHzFxNTdpRP4OSK6FjFQ7ohqGQW3v/u2XYtvv9jcgZR5\n+yIEwYi2LdhzKJQIiM7ohTUK/oQfeKAXu952IR97mo81YQsOsC9GGx6okTPhZEYZ\nQfGKR0tlKtJphL8yBDz10wzBpbaBTqsP0ruTd8MR9qVZwyp0WcEMfH4fHBuqwt4h\n6ztF331VP9JYPZMIOURFNakK4FOWaoDQl1Ih+aBrxGsXAH9jFsOOADvEk1Wc/2Ii\nRIlv5/ZZRMgBsAawJEGKBwXD8i2+TCuihZoLkUxstmmexvoYAdSGii38mad/PPC0\nYsGa0ex72BLdYyNj1eHrSuZ1+USwjVe7lXVhNroX1fXl4WKT2WmrGB6O7Dyd9mbN\nUhr9u5+FvFGINMK2oQlL\n=gvwX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-25T19:25:58Z"}},"c