ew<branch>.txt per workflow;\nthe file''s notice mentions the agent environment and shouldn''t enter\nthe repo if it ever gets accidentally staged.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"228454c2b4bb750c6305dde1f0f81adcdd94c9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/228454c2b4bb750c6305dde1f0f81adcdd94c9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/58f3e3f540a2537a462a293531c8425e156c8ea0","verification":{"payload":"tree 228454c2b4bb750c6305dde1f0f81adcdd94c9af\nparent 58fcf71cb6cc3dcc3ec726a005ace96c8769b356\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1779593069 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779593069 +1200\n\nchore(tsconfig): tighten strict-TS flags (#27)\n\n* chore(tsconfig): enable additional strict flags\n\nAdd noUncheckedIndexedAccess, noImplicitReturns,\nnoFallthroughCasesInSwitch, and noImplicitOverride to both tsconfigs to\nmatch signalk-backup''s strictness bar. No source changes were required —\nthe existing code is already compatible with the tighter checks.\n\n* chore(gitignore): ignore cr-review output files\n\nLocal cr review runs are saved to cr-review<branch>.txt per workflow;\nthe file''s notice mentions the agent environment and shouldn''t enter\nthe repo if it ever gets accidentally staged.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEm9tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9c8QAEwTbS/OiqhepiUAURpYyPrn\nvgfbPmRhl2YA+/mBsuwqVT7nSkJ5763mzxNuZzxbbXuM6UqPcmjCzXI0m0eJQmhg\n8fZ9ltQaGTFGADsG3Mvc5LloFG4IU42oSvku/Fw90PXXV5Dk9qD5bGaAcTpGojGk\noL0b4M8j4IVy9cOHPglzLGI5K3n0c3i+05mxqBfxk9EGeoX4NMGjwNF1LCmMlo+j\nWbRMwBwarjqVPoFWBQ222z4lr8ymT9gMblGPUgnRN+ptj/ZfI5UHcT7qvKLLt00q\nhyWT7G35Fkh5ycIGD7dFw0eIz9bmaGRoEQv5mX5mlgnOwtI7Xuwan3vg1vtoPXNy\nEjQnQi6u2OqkplgbW3qRTwXyucHvshwfLIrrqGnSI0BAhr6X7GOL5/ccbIQMLJB1\nmAqmQ8kZFXQOPu+nGYEazl3/La1oh0pNhd3smGvnR