4:36Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:24:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: thin-shell plugin for signalk-doctor-server (#1)\n\nMirrors signalk-updater #1. Same pattern: adopt-only via\nupdates.register(), no ensureRunning, redirect webapp, never crash\nsignalk-server on failure.\n\nTargets:\n- ghcr.io/dirkwa/signalk-doctor-server, container name ''signalk-doctor-\n  server''.\n- Webapp redirects to http://localhost:3004 by default.\n- Fallback prose when the doctor itself is unreachable points the user\n  at ~/.local/bin/signalk-recovery (CC-3 SSH safety net), not at the\n  updater — the doctor IS the recovery surface, so this codepath needs\n  to send users to the bash script when even the doctor is dead.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5995ee728029659d901f2230ce67244fc5fa399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/trees/b5995ee728029659d901f2230ce67244fc5fa399"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-doctor/git/commits/f64052c98f8603ae675f37a162552adb4652b035","verification":{"payload":"tree b5995ee728029659d901f2230ce67244fc5fa399\nparent 79b81d62852f23a4556186e084784dbd94768827\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1779481476 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779481476 +1200\n\nfeat: thin-shell plugin for signalk-doctor-server (#1)\n\nMirrors signalk-updater #1. Same pattern: adopt-only via\nupdates.register(), no ensureRunning, redirect webapp, never crash\nsignalk-server on failure.\n\nTargets:\n- ghcr.io/dirkwa/signalk-doctor-server, container name ''signalk-doctor-\n  server''.\n- Webapp redirects to http://localhost:3004 by default.\n- Fallback prose when the doctor itself is unreachable points the user\n  at ~/.local/bin/signalk-recovery (CC-3 SSH safety net), not at the\n  updater — the doctor IS the recovery surface,