paris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzM3MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/d6da8e722a2f2bd83269515d2f80c73b86ec0e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T20:03:16Z","email":"jacob@jacobparis.com","name":"Jacob Paris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T20:03:16Z","email":"jacob@jacobparis.com","name":"Jacob Paris"},"message":"README: document current state honestly\n\nThree additions surfaced by this development session:\n\n1. Status section up front explaining the streaming dependency on\n   opencode PR #26076. Workspace creation/management works; chat\n   streaming back to the host TUI does not until that PR lands. The\n   plugin''s runtime module already comments on this assumption.\n\n2. Updated OpenCode version requirement to >= 1.15.5 (uses\n   experimental_workspace.register) and made the git-project requirement\n   explicit (opencode''s own API rejects non-git projects at the boundary\n   with WorktreeNotGitError, before our plugin is ever called).\n\n3. Orphan sandbox cleanup section. Failed creates leave the sandbox\n   running on purpose for debugging, but users need to know they''re\n   consuming quota and how to clean them up (opencode UI or vercel\n   CLI).","tree":{"sha":"e6f7f423adfa84ec2762959d00538c903192e4a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/git/trees/e6f7f423adfa84ec2762959d00538c903192e4a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/git/commits/d6da8e722a2f2bd83269515d2f80c73b86ec0e3c","verification":{"payload":"tree e6f7f423adfa84ec2762959d00538c903192e4a8\nparent e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1\nauthor Jacob Paris <jacob@jacobparis.com> 1779739396 -0400\ncommitter Jacob Paris <jacob@jacobparis.com> 1779739396 -0400\n\nREADME: document current state honestly\n\nThree additions surfaced by this development session:\n\n1. Status section up front explaining the streaming dependency on\n   opencode PR #26076. Workspace creation/management works; chat\n   streaming back to the host TUI does not until that PR lands. The\n   plugin''s runtime module already comments on this assumption.\n\n2. Updated OpenCode version requirement to >= 1.15.5 (uses\n   experimental_workspace.register) and made the git-project requirement\n   explicit (opencode''s own API rejects non-git projects at the boundary\n   with WorktreeNotGitError, before our plugin is ever called).\n\n3. Orphan sandbox cleanup section. Failed creates leave the sandbox\n   running on purpose for debugging, but users need to know they''re\n   consuming quota and how to clean them up (opencode UI or vercel\n   CLI).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg47UeB9Ypg8RKJMRYBBb4hFTTx/\n1P1PbmBkG9pCut344AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQF+/4Ph3X2PVR8o2Zr2yMPBEdUppio6m4msFtLbKIOZLrQmeclG2pf0fiGZ3EPlJzg\nY+LxU5H30YKbgy5j7CDgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-25T20:03:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5633704?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis","id":5633704,"login":"jacobparis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzM3MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commit/d6da8e722a2f2bd83269515d2f80c73b86ec0e3c","node_id":"C_kwDOSlSpWtoAKGQ2ZGE4ZTcyMmEyZjJiZDgzMjY5NTE1ZDJmODBjNzNiODZlYzBlM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commit/e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1","sha":"e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1"}],"sha":"d6da8e722a2f2bd83269515d2f80c73b86ec0e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/d6da8e722a2f2bd83269515d2f80c73b86ec0e3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5633704?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis","id":5633704,"login":"jacobparis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzM3MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T18:18:31Z","email":"jacob@jacobparis.com","name":"Jacob Paris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T18:18:31Z","email":"jacob@jacobparis.com","name":"Jacob Paris"},"message":"Add progress logs to uncommitted overlay path\n\nA real session hung for 35 minutes inside applyUncommittedFromHost with\nno log output between three silent git commands and a sandbox.writeFiles\ncall. Without per-step breadcrumbs the deadlock was undiagnosable.\n\nAdds debug logs before each silent operation:\n- git fetch origin <branch>\n- git diff <base> --binary\n- git ls-files --others --exclude-standard\n- sandbox.writeFiles (with fileCount + totalBytes)\n- git apply in sandbox\n\nDebug-level so production logs aren''t noisy unless\nOPENCODE_SANDBOX_DEBUG=1 is set.","tree":{"sha":"0c61fed3f301aec44454c14ce98f901e481d77e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/git/trees/0c61fed3f301aec44454c14ce98f901e481d77e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/git/commits/e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c61fed3f301aec44454c14ce98f901e481d77e4\nparent f598f13efd3f7c1eb94dd8c160c81b363fb347bb\nauthor Jacob Paris <jacob@jacobparis.com> 1779733111 -0400\ncommitter Jacob Paris <jacob@jacobparis.com> 1779733111 -0400\n\nAdd progress logs to uncommitted overlay path\n\nA real session hung for 35 minutes inside applyUncommittedFromHost with\nno log output between three silent git commands and a sandbox.writeFiles\ncall. Without per-step breadcrumbs the deadlock was undiagnosable.\n\nAdds debug logs before each silent operation:\n- git fetch origin <branch>\n- git diff <base> --binary\n- git ls-files --others --exclude-standard\n- sandbox.writeFiles (with fileCount + totalBytes)\n- git apply in sandbox\n\nDebug-level so production logs aren''t noisy unless\nOPENCODE_SANDBOX_DEBUG=1 is set.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg47UeB9Ypg8RKJMRYBBb4hFTTx/\n1P1PbmBkG9pCut344AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKjfWP1ae7uxEN/qkAQ007xO+i+clEBcmE3XFXi4Uxwsd0RnjblJNTspW9KXT499vM\nrltoBEtwjUQLBB45WKPQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-25T18:18:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5633704?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis","id":5633704,"login":"jacobparis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzM3MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commit/e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSlSpWtoAKGU5YjIyMTY3ZDE3OTdhMjg1YjhiZmI1YzY0NDUzOTExMjE0NDIwZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commit/f598f13efd3f7c1eb94dd8c160c81b363fb347bb","sha":"f598f13efd3f7c1eb94dd8c160c81b363fb347bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/f598f13efd3f7c1eb94dd8c160c81b363fb347bb"}],"sha":"e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/e9b22167d1797a285b8bfb5c64453911214420f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5633704?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis","id":5633704,"login":"jacobparis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzM3MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/commits/f598f13efd3f7c1eb94dd8c160c81b363fb347bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:28:59Z","email":"jacob@jacobparis.com","name":"Jacob Paris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T21:28:59Z","email":"jacob@jacobparis.com","name":"Jacob Paris"},"message":"Initial commit: opencode workspace plugin for Vercel Sandbox\n\nOpenCode workspace adapter that runs sessions inside persistent Vercel\nSandboxes. Clones the workspace''s github branch into a microVM, installs\nopencode, starts `opencode serve`, and proxies the workspace to the\nhost opencode TUI via Basic auth.\n\nSurface:\n- src/index.ts        plugin entrypoint, adapter wiring, logger\n- src/runtime.ts      WorkspaceRuntime: target dedup, heartbeat, health\n                      probe + serve relaunch\n- src/configure.ts    git probing, github auth, opencode version detection\n- src/create.ts       sandbox provisioning, install, plugin-spec stripping\n- src/remove.ts       sandbox teardown\n- src/uncommitted.ts  overlay working-tree diff onto sandbox\n- src/pull-vercel.ts  mirror host Vercel project state\n- src/auth/           github + vercel auth providers\n- src/options.ts      plugin config parsing with validation\n- src/network-policy.ts  curated egress allowlist\n- src/types.ts        WorkspaceExtra, Context, Logger\n- src/vercel.ts       Vercel SDK adapter (Sandbox.create/get/delete)\n\nConstraints honored:\n- Only github.com remotes supported in v1\n- Vercel Sandbox SDK is NOT mocked; tests cover pure helpers only\n- opencode''s WorktreeNotGitError means non-git projects are out of scope","tree":{"sha":"0241b186359d5d0e665ebb71b1eee73044ea1b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/git/trees/0241b186359d5d0e665ebb71b1eee73044ea1b52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jacobparis/opencode-sandbox/git/commits/f598f13efd3f7c1eb94dd8c160c81b363fb347bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 0241b186359d5d0e665ebb71b1eee73044ea1b52\nauthor Jacob Paris <jacob@jacobparis.com> 1779485339 -0400\ncommitter Jacob Paris <jacob@jacobparis.com> 1779485339 -0400\n\nInitial commit: opencode workspace plugin for Vercel Sandbox\n\nOpenCode workspace adapter that runs sessions inside persistent Vercel\nSandboxes. Clones the workspace''s github branch into a microVM, installs\nopencode, starts `opencode serve`, and proxies the workspace to the\nhost opencode TUI via Basic auth.\n\nSurface:\n- src/index.ts        plugin entrypoint, adapter wiring, logger\n- src/runtime.ts      WorkspaceRuntime: target dedup, heartbeat, health\n                      probe + serve relaunch\n- src/configure.ts    git probing, github auth, opencode version detection\n- src/create.ts       sandbox provisioning, install, plugin-spec stripping\n- src/remove.ts       sandbox teardown\n- src/uncommitted.ts  overlay working-tree diff onto sandbox\n- src/pull-vercel.ts  mirror host Vercel project state\n- src/auth/           github + vercel auth providers\n- src/options.ts      plugin config parsing with validation\n- src/network-policy.ts  curated egress allowlist\n- src/types.ts        WorkspaceExtra, Context, Logger\n- src/vercel.ts       Vercel SDK adapter (Sandbox.create/get/delete)\n\nConstraints honored:\n- Only github.com remotes supported in v1\n- Vercel Sandbox SDK is NOT mocked; tests cover pure helpers only\n- opencode''s WorktreeNotGitError means non-git projects are out of scope\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg47UeB9Ypg8RKJMRYBBb4hFTTx/\n1P1PbmBkG9pCut344AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPAzLAPzlDjwsUPrveCdGsVUsSTNg7D0hypvnin1DKZGxsmy26zlJ7NJ4iRne1zJkk\nfaR81nIccQD7S06URWEA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T21:29:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5633704?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobparis","id":5633704,"login":"jacobparis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzM3MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobparis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jacobpa