-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T18:51:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commit/f2ef50113a767b58274fbd09102bb41ee2284bf6","node_id":"C_kwDOSlWQwtoAKGYyZWY1MDExM2E3NjdiNTgyNzRmYmQwOTEwMmJiNDFlZTIyODRiZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commit/7dc73d8bf5f6d8f57c2b27a948fb3b7fe474837e","sha":"7dc73d8bf5f6d8f57c2b27a948fb3b7fe474837e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commits/7dc73d8bf5f6d8f57c2b27a948fb3b7fe474837e"}],"sha":"f2ef50113a767b58274fbd09102bb41ee2284bf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commits/f2ef50113a767b58274fbd09102bb41ee2284bf6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192421473?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adrianstanca1","id":192421473,"login":"adrianstanca1","node_id":"U_kgDOC3geYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commits/7dc73d8bf5f6d8f57c2b27a948fb3b7fe474837e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:51:38Z","email":"adrian.stanca1@gmail.com","name":"adrian stanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:51:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(llm): send keep_alive from the legacy Express /api/llm proxy (#286)\n\nThe Express /api/llm proxy on port 3000 called Ollama /api/chat with no\nkeep_alive, so it paid Ollama''s 5-minute unload policy: every post-idle\nrequest reloaded the model (~3.3s on qwen3:4b, measured). Same defect\nPR #285 fixed on the Next.js lib/llm.ts path.\n\nAdds keepAliveField() with identical semantics: default 30m, empty/default\nomits the field so Ollama applies its own default, duration strings pass\nthrough, and bare numerics are emitted as JSON numbers -- Ollama parses\nstring durations with Go''s time.ParseDuration, which rejects a unitless\n\"-1\" with HTTP 400 \"missing unit in duration\" (verified against a live\nserver).\n\nCo-authored-by: adrian stanca <192421473+adrianstanca1@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06679c6f0a937d87180b072ca7e62640c9c1a994","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/git/trees/06679c6f0a937d87180b072ca7e62640c9c1a994"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/git/commits/7dc73d8bf5f6d8f57c2b27a948fb3b7fe474837e","verification":{"payload":"tree 06679c6f0a937d87180b072ca7e62640c9c1a994\nparent 8ad5ea518a6accc5c9f9291c9c81e6255e135c31\nauthor adrian stanca <adrian.stanca1@gmail.com> 1791305498 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791305498 +0100\n\nfix(llm): send keep_alive from the legacy Express /api/llm proxy (#286)\n\nThe Express /api/llm proxy on port 3000 called Ollama /api/chat with no\nkeep_alive, so it paid Ollama''s 5-minute unload policy: every post-idle\nrequest reloaded the model (~3.3s on qwen3:4b, measured). Same defect\nPR #285 fixed on the Next.js lib/llm.ts path.\n\nAdds keepAliveField() with identical semantics: default 30m, empty/default\nomits the field so Ollama applies its own default, duration strings pass\nthrough, and bare numerics are emitted as JSON numbers -- Ollama parses\nstring durations with Go''s time.ParseDuration, which rejects a unitless\n\"-1\" with HTTP 400 \"missing unit in duration\" (verified against a live\nserver).\n\nCo-authored-by: adrian stanca <192421473+adrianstanca1@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxScaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApxoQAC6Gj6ZJ9DDncsdJJU5fkmF0\naeoWTrbdWGsWoPHPfHI8JxFr2xeluRN32a5HxAr1hCvuLV1D05E6hyPG0qxjrNCv\nADBcVRASfjg9j0bxiu7y4lFnrFW6voOrSJKc4Nxedtd0QFWVUdirWImaRjWtya39\n040zAUUKg0tUOMJdOivpmE3fcj3Kn3mLhulfz1eOfsEugqcI7u18unRk6dyRHy6y\nZ6JHZ9YBLnf4p0V7a6JkqUgzsD6JY/NMn8XSSkjhWzmd2vapNg2P5I/iwjJLcfZw\nzsARwSThFaciC3mB11CZ0sqCqR0WMMsmAqPW8VzY34xOMPoFozbXe766AziSrNI5\n+2lf4dsbS2ZF5L518qIg+9P0oAcmsToFPUT4tPlTUgB0nA9Wtwcd7ODg8CFPCcgM\n8MLI7MBH2ghkCZDWeGp/ToXi0YXeyHVF5Tb/KeOxOmdWbjPqLuxRvqoLUNYvVNSn\nqsud9cdCo6CUyNxpjneOlO84ExngNg9NxPc+nqnafGmjVe/TE5ID4BMpFg8/alka\n27W/oB+Jevk+nzqlnwq8mTQopGGgEPmma9VdXOm5H5cPturhVKGPFxvJ6nPvr5aL\nEV0L5xZbrll+JGUd