3cc1707330267e05f2011","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commits/fe282ae2ab027d672b63cc1707330267e05f2011"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192421473?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adrianstanca1","id":192421473,"login":"adrianstanca1","node_id":"U_kgDOC3geYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adrianstanca1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/commits/c42dbb8551b9e37b16f216bcca6846492e90b6ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:19:22Z","email":"adrian.stanca1@gmail.com","name":"adrian stanca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:19:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Make bulk task progress atomic and batched (#275)\n\n* fix: scope bulk task progress writes to the request org\n\nBulk task complete/reopen/delete wrote fallback project progress outside\nany transaction and read the organisation id from a session field that\nrequireAuth() never populates. Both are fixed:\n\n- Wrap the task mutation and its progress refresh in one\n  prisma.$transaction so a progress write failure can no longer leave\n  tasks changed but project progress stale.\n- Resolve the org from getCurrentOrg() (the request-scoped tenancy\n  context requireAuth() actually sets) instead of auth.orgId, which was\n  undefined and made every bulk request throw into a 500.\n- Restore the dropped `next/server` import for NextRequest/NextResponse.\n- Batch the progress recompute behind a single grouped read via\n  syncTaskProjectProgress, preserving programme ownership and tenant\n  scoping on the write.\n\n* fix: enforce tenant RBAC in bulk task mutations\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: adrian stanca <192421473+adrianstanca1@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc5b55cb04e4622d0f9bc5bb568843320be87d41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/git/trees/bc5b55cb04e4622d0f9bc5bb568843320be87d41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adrianstanca1/cortexx/git/commits/c42dbb8551b9e37b16f216bcca6846492e90b6ae","verification":{"payload":"tree bc5b55cb04e4622d0f9bc5bb568843320be87d41\nparent 556ab8c9c63ffe1a4ba5180ff3822531231e46f0\nauthor adrian stanca <adrian.stanca1@gmail.com> 1791105562 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791105562 +0100\n\nMake bulk task progress atomic and batched (#275)\n\n* fix: scope bulk task progress writes to the request org\n\nBulk task complete/reopen/delete wrote fallback project progress outside\nany transaction and read the organisation id from a session field that\nrequireAuth() never populates. Both are fixed:\n\n- Wrap the task mutation and its progress refresh in one\n  prisma.$transaction so a progress write failure can no longer leave\n  tasks changed but project progress stale.\n- Resolve the org from getCurrentOrg() (the request-scoped tenancy\n  context requireAuth() actually sets) instead of auth.orgId, which was\n  undefined and made every bulk request throw into a 500.\n- Restore the dropped `next/server` import for NextRequest/NextResponse.\n- Batch the progress recompute behind a single grouped read via\n  syncTaskProjectProgress, preserving programme ownership and tenant\n  scoping on the write.\n\n* fix: enforce tenant RBAC in bulk task mutations\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: adrian stanca <192421473+adrianstanca1@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwhoaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS5wQAKM/acBh7pAoiWJqu7lpqS6C\nk3ym8T/QEo1GQ7E0FKXXJqIIQwLZxn5jNQ8w04Xs3D8WLIJdGi71uc6NAT+hz/p6\nbfg1GGm/muIoIN7tE27X6lwUO3b5yK1z0zFdzMRwb2nMxgqeVq1m/Z+lXf40+iFp\nvURt6TpB/DRSUPP7pU/Oyvu9eV3ArWVNV4FlDXwJSxn8pI0lI5idN8zlLC+Lw1CH\n3kJUY8EcrzSEwmNicfAJIgKhnJ88vr+4lvTOcrwZr8fNJdQudYV4sbcckpkr81h0\nTzGeCfp4555I7xDBh3zvNw0ESyVeYA2p4DiAB9keqLDy87yYY2bRqKyio7Gyg9fM\n9uZVSn030pdpcozH87GTUPcNYwHwLsvruCXEDn/mHwG54LufhEi12OMb5B/oQsB7\nYKxxBJ3WA5oa+8asbEjXOYh5tkW5zBdTmx7wjwckcwkaanTj9DLxOtnpp+ju/dF5\nXWc5hZ/C5GFPrJVWIsNttyv99AZGQTTj+MCt6FwGQAVg0AvBYHj8Is0YEDCYbM5F\nsOsSPo8B3RSfEgGJmlOGl2iPSWxPEfwYlaiBuORRhictv1g7nAaSpK5ikZeSu5Va\nL7VlhY9PZFXktzXWJq2QHwrhgPiCX0+X/bV/eCh29XMg0duXwA7Lqs+Oyb61y5UO\nM+tjiEyZs1ecu5aAdD3S\n=fqII\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T09:19:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"htm