rendered.\nThe Deployment references imagePullSecrets[ghcr-pull-secret] — without\nthis ExternalSecret the pod cannot pull from ghcr.io and stays in\nImagePullBackOff, causing ProgressDeadlineExceeded.\n\nThe overlay namespace (mfe-shell-dev) overrides the hardcoded namespace\nin the file via kustomize namespace transformer.\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d406e50ba8a001693dbb78bbebc96d0690c7fc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/trees/6d406e50ba8a001693dbb78bbebc96d0690c7fc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/commits/c9b8b179bae298c79cc73c91109e5009e38ee117","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d406e50ba8a001693dbb78bbebc96d0690c7fc5\nparent ba70bac7126a34d61ea4f59c7359587ef23af85a\nauthor maximilianberghoffwecoya <maximilian.berghoff@wecoya.com> 1783327173 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783327173 +0200\n\nfix(k8s): wire ghcr-pull-secret.yaml into base kustomization (#36)\n\nghcr-pull-secret.yaml was created by a template-sync commit but never\nadded to the resources list, so the ExternalSecret was never rendered.\nThe Deployment references imagePullSecrets[ghcr-pull-secret] — without\nthis ExternalSecret the pod cannot pull from ghcr.io and stays in\nImagePullBackOff, causing ProgressDeadlineExceeded.\n\nThe overlay namespace (mfe-shell-dev) overrides the hardcoded namespace\nin the file via kustomize namespace transformer.\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqS2nGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADR4QAF+zp34dr6jxwSQ/4YbTZ7RU\n3iU5Ngn1u/RHXHyAg9mwVTn+3e4Hev8PuWvl797kVTFmMXIRIv4/1gUQUxgQI6sU\nG9pvHKWU3TnmXdFtju6/NCr+IFQWn49zXaKE3pnT4QwjxgIU56doQX8M54B8oO2u\nVHo24g3uhmK18GdeLiQE31WrPDxHbUkoTbENl1MnZnump6SyuT0HrNVoPLLZOwUr\nxRWtLTSmJlLx2TzdjAtyr