12,"login":"maximilianberghoffwecoya","node_id":"U_kgDODTxTxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/commits/19b0ce430aeb72b8e049062350884f1230bfd947/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T19:16:47Z","email":"maximilian.berghoff@wecoya.com","name":"maximilianberghoffwecoya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T19:16:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(task-13.13): grafana dashboard title, namespace filter and Backstage links (#30)\n\n* fix(task-13.13): grafana dashboard title, namespace filter and Backstage links\n\n- Title: \"MFE Overview — mfe-shell\"; uid was already mfe-mfe-shell\n- Namespace variable scoped to mfe-shell.* (was unscoped)\n- All namespace=\"$namespace\" → namespace=~\"$namespace\" in 13 expressions\n- catalog-info: add grafana/dashboard-selector, dashboard-overview annotation with var-namespace=All\n\nPlatform issue: Wecoya/private-sovereign-cloud#1134\n\n* fix(copier): add owner/bounded_context and correct _src_path to vue-mfe\n\ntemplate-consumers.yaml registers mfe-shell as a vue-mfe consumer but\n.copier-answers.yml still pointed at web-app template. vue-mfe requires\nowner and bounded_context (no defaults) — without them copier --defaults\npasses \"\" → validator fails → template-sync silently skips the sync PR.\n\n- _src_path: web-app → vue-mfe (align with template-consumers.yaml)\n- owner: wecoya/platform-team\n- bounded_context: platform  (→ system: platform-system in catalog-info.yaml)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c1b0a29ab272fe19e69ee428f8440212cf90e01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/trees/7c1b0a29ab272fe19e69ee428f8440212cf90e01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/commits/19b0ce430aeb72b8e049062350884f1230bfd947","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c1b0a29ab272fe19e69ee428f8440212cf90e01\nparent 67d0406f11a2a39ea62bd12b1070ef66a325add6\nauthor maximilianberghoffwecoya <maximilian.berghoff@wecoya.com> 1782760607 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782760607 +0200\n\nfix(task-13.13): grafana dashboard title, namespace filter and Backstage links (#30)\n\n* fix(task-13.13): grafana dashboard title, namespace filter and Backstage links\n\n- Title: \"MFE Overview — mfe-shell\"; uid was already mfe-mfe-shell\n- Namespace variable scoped to mfe-shell.* (was unscoped)\n- All namespace=\"$namespace\" → namespace=~\"$namespace\" in 13 expressions\n- catalog-info: add grafana/dashboard-selector, dashboard-overview annotation with var-namespace=All\n\nPlatform issue: Wecoya/private-sovereign-cloud#1134\n\n* fix(copier): add owner/bounded_context and correct _src_path to vue-mfe\n\ntemplate-consumers.yaml registers mfe-shell as a vue-mfe consumer but\n.copier-answers.yml still pointed at web-app template. vue-mfe requires\nowner and bounded_context (no defaults) — without them copier --defaults\npasses \"\" → validator fails → template-sync silently skips the sync PR.\n\n- _src_path: web-app → vue-mfe (align with template-consumers.yaml)\n- owner: wecoya/platform-team\n- bounded_context: platform  (→ system: platform-system in catalog-info.yaml)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQsSfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/EUQAHAFnGow1Hh1i8RGJIEs/Kbo\nvfmCz6plI