es to land in mfe-shell-dev but\nthe mfe-shell-registry ArgoCD app (ghcr-pull-secret) was in mfe-shell.\nPods couldn''t start because the pull secret wasn''t in the right namespace.\n\nChanges:\n- namespace: mfe-shell-dev → mfe-shell\n- Remove certificate.yaml from resources (Ingress uses wildcard cert)\n- Fix patches/ingress.yaml: namespace, host, secretName all corrected\n\nPattern: matches secret-sharing (namespace = service name, no env suffix).\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>\nCo-authored-by: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>","tree":{"sha":"79abce081444e8691e34eb7b16fec37d8b7b75bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/trees/79abce081444e8691e34eb7b16fec37d8b7b75bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/commits/61fa699a6d272a77a8ce901fc5db60448c892d3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 79abce081444e8691e34eb7b16fec37d8b7b75bd\nparent 169a4d3e35219eb190549e231faa29e288377465\nauthor maximilianberghoffwecoya <maximilian.berghoff@wecoya.com> 1780986075 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780986075 +0200\n\nfix(k8s): use mfe-shell namespace without -dev suffix in dev overlay (#19)\n\nThe -dev namespace suffix caused resources to land in mfe-shell-dev but\nthe mfe-shell-registry ArgoCD app (ghcr-pull-secret) was in mfe-shell.\nPods couldn''t start because the pull secret wasn''t in the right namespace.\n\nChanges:\n- namespace: mfe-shell-dev → mfe-shell\n- Remove certificate.yaml from resources (Ingress uses wildcard cert)\n- Fix patches/ingress.yaml: namespace, host, secretName all corrected\n\nPattern: matches secret-sharing (namespace = service name, no env suffix).\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>\nCo-authored-by: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJ7DbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY40QAD/4UyU07QbPCHSSFazQmTUB\nNci7PKzUmCiUhVzRq4X15diFlr+Po0+twrqY4SicXnUnL0Gfxujgjc7JhUm7444h\npbq/iFxhBDFiqNkNJ7lgqO0pDSS