ecoya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilianberghoffwecoya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/commits/aba84f15427124ec45191d7fd52d4a5d004d221f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T01:58:10Z","email":"maximilian.berghoff@wecoya.com","name":"maximilianberghoffwecoya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T01:58:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(k8s): replace unrendered MFE_NAME vars and fix cert/config issues (PSC #519) (#13)\n\n* fix(k8s): replace unrendered MFE_NAME vars in all manifests (closes #519)\n\nAfter template-sync, all k8s manifests had raw MFE_NAME placeholder\nreferences instead of the rendered service name ''mfe-shell''.\n\nAffected files: deployment.yaml, service.yaml, configmap.yaml,\nnetwork-policy.yaml, kustomization.yaml (base + all 3 overlays),\ncertificate.yaml (dev/staging/prod), patches/configmap.yaml\n(dev/staging/prod), patches/ingress.yaml (dev/staging/prod),\npatches/replicas.yaml (prod), resource-quota.yaml (dev).\n\nAlso fixed malformed YAML in staging/prod kustomization.yaml (stray\nembedded text fragments from the broken template-sync run).\n\nCo-Authored-By: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>\n\n* fix(k8s): fix certificate dnsNames, staging Keycloak URL, resource-quota label\n\n- certificate.yaml: fix dnsNames to match actual Ingress hostnames\n  (shell-dev, shell-staging, shell.app.wecoya.online) and add note\n  that wildcard cert is used by Ingress\n- staging patches/configmap.yaml: restore KEYCLOAK_URL to staging\n  endpoint (https://auth.staging.wecoya.de), not production\n- dev resource-quota.yaml: fix app.kubernetes.io/part-of from\n  mfe-shell to wecoya-platform (generic namespace resource)\n- kustomization.yaml: fix domain comment in dev overlay; add\n  clarifying comment that patches/ingress.yaml is a resource not a patch\n\nCo-Authored-By: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>\n\n* fix(k8s): revert staging KEYCLOAK_URL — single shared Keycloak instance\n\nid.plattform.wecoya.online is the correct URL for all environments.\nauth.staging.wecoya.de does not exist and was introduced by mistake.\n\nCo-Authored-By: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>\nCo-authored-by: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>","tree":{"sha":"39bd562454994e8ba16650661fdbf21b3e4d1509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/trees/39bd562454994e8ba16650661fdbf21b3e4d1509"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/commits/aba84f15427124ec45191d7fd52d4a5d004d221f","verification":{"payload":"tree 39bd562454994e8ba16650661fdbf21b3e4d1509\nparent 738cd9f41dde1a3da9ae24a80e56876c62aa72ab\nauthor maximilianberghoffwecoya <maximilian.berghoff@wecoya.com> 1780970290 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780970290 +0200\n\nfix(k8s): replace unrendered MFE_NAME vars and fix cert/config issues (PSC #519) (#13)\n\n* fix(k8s): replace unrendered MFE_NAME vars in all manifests (closes #519)\n\nAfter template-sync, all k8s manifests had raw MFE_NAME placeholder\nreferences instead of the rendered service name ''mfe-shell''.\n\nAffected files: deployment.yaml, service.yaml, configmap.yaml,\nnetwork-policy.yaml, kustomization.yaml (base + all 3 overlays),\ncertificate.yaml (dev/staging/prod), patches/configmap.yaml\n(dev/staging/prod), patches/ingress.yaml (dev/staging/prod),\npatches/replicas.yaml (prod), resource-quota.yaml (dev).\n\nAlso fixed malformed YAML in staging/prod kustomization.yaml (stray\nembedded text fragments from the broken template-sync run).\n\nCo-Authored-By: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>\n\n* fix(k8s): fix certificate dnsNames, staging Keycloak URL, resource-quota label\n\n- certificate.yaml: fix dnsNames to match actual Ingress hostnames\n  (shell-dev, shell-staging, shell.app.wecoya.online) and add note\n  that wildcard cert is used by Ingress\n- staging patches/configmap.yaml: restore KEYCLOAK_URL to staging\n  endpoint (https://auth.staging.wecoya.de), not production\n- dev resource-quota.yaml: fix app.kubernetes.io/part-of from\n  mfe-shell to wecoya-platform (generic namespace resource)\n- kustomization.yaml: fix domain comment in dev overlay; add\n  clarifying comment that patches/ingress.yaml is a resource not a patch\n\nCo-Authored-By: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>\n\n* fix(k8s): revert staging KEYCLOAK_URL — single shared Keycloak instance\n\nid.plattform.wecoya.online is the correct URL for all environments.\nauth.staging.wecoya.de does not exist and was introduced by mistake.\n\nCo-Authored-By: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: electricmaxxxx <maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com>\nCo-authored-by: RuFlo <ruv@ruv.net>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJ3MyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKAYQAFCX7zZYVo47XIuoW1R/Pu9W\nXXZD6yqL23L9r1/3ST3VlR3wOXQnROAgjpxrlDQG3mycqtEXx7PbvdjkCbyz19hE\naRzV56Zdz6XCyOcyMVya1s4etr4+o8xq62qizjZ2ywBdGH0ecIyxzcO37mOz6bcI\nKi+G4Z8xNxmr3HVHzItt4Cu/b2jMv6u9qKSGbkmlJWN13zInMjQh8frJLTTAf3GU\nN1rquHuxpk/+6CF5CTwhSxFwOz8Yt9YbyKZTN7QL+6WCUiF0eqYeHv92VwGi/qn6\n4xILobTtstzhVmNnul/hgr82SlucJQs8GmWy9IQJam+Nbtj09XKrjzqOkKNZ2KrG\n6p0QNbaTgNmpt4fDfiL/aEpNCX47y6WZubjRv7k/J4rn3fvnw7eh23DZD0zFJALK\nxVQltHQXV+3XGrdDsH+TGFZQ/XYZJVyFoBviiTO6cLovJCdHFYXgBEhSjzfb/G/y\nwJYISt5kkx2KTjAKi1UglS988Z8BFXTHkQY8ev8HZNsyusRHHOPQPUtYR0pzcHyC\n6InbU9ZiaiNQltwKEAHzMpwZiqN1c8Mgw4Yr4VAR/28sgk66ZiFkrrjEIZtSQb3G\ng3UuTJ+eqHdEXnoUjAmpnYtbbabCJq0xRAIREjoMBNxKCZnGuKi8BLoKnfU7A5cG\nXGMSv1aomiXdGQRlsKxO\n=iQB4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-09T01:58:11Z"}},"com