gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/electricmaxxxx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/electricmaxxxx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/electricmaxxxx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/electricmaxxxx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/electricmaxxxx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/commits/8770cfe43419cd60ec0337ba64f834afa7676ecc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:08:39Z","email":"maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com","name":"electricmaxxxx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:08:39Z","email":"maximilian.berghoff@googlemail.com","name":"electricmaxxxx"},"message":"feat(monitoring): add per-service monitoring bootstrap\n\nAdds Day-1 observability to the MFE Shell application:\n\n- k8s/base/service-monitor.yaml       — Prometheus scrape config (port http/8080, 30s)\n- k8s/base/prometheus-rule.yaml       — ServiceHighErrorRate + ServiceDown alerts\n- k8s/base/monitoring/grafana-dashboard.json — RED + System + Loki panels\n- k8s/base/monitoring/grafana-dashboard-configmap.yaml — auto-imported by Grafana sidecar\n- k8s/base/kustomization.yaml         — wires monitoring resources + configMapGenerator\n- k8s/base/network-policy.yaml        — allows Prometheus scrape from monitoring namespace\n\nAlert severity escalation per environment:\n  dev:     warning  (default)\n  staging: ServiceDown → critical (no PagerDuty)\n  prod:    both → critical + alertmanager_route: pagerduty\n\nPattern source: wecoya/private-sovereign-cloud apps/_templates/service/\nHow-to: docs/how-to/monitoring-per-service.md\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4072fa7c0dbc6829f047af8a8b129898829eb6c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wecoya/mfe-shell/git/trees/4072fa7c0dbc6829f047af8a8b129898829eb6c1"},"url":"https