mote paths.\nLocal paths (when fs = \"/\") failed if the remote path was empty or\nhad invalid leading slashes. Cloud remotes required a trailing colon.\n\nAdded `formatRcParams` helper in `RcloneDaemonManager` to reliably structure\nthe `fs` and `remote` parameters for `operations/mkdir`, `operations/purge`,\n`operations/deletefile`, `operations/list`, `operations/movefile`,\n`operations/copyfile`, and `operations/stat`. This ensures creating\nand deleting files/folders from the UI succeeds.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2becf8b58bc047b6a181628c2e375aa72e43b464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/2becf8b58bc047b6a181628c2e375aa72e43b464"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/3d1b7857df5fa1563612bc95c066403192e4f955","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bo