"email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T10:07:45Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(deploy): synchronize mongodb environment variable in relay deployment\n\n- Updated `deploy_relay.sh` to explicitly read, write, and export `MONGODB_URI` instead of `MONGO_URI`.\n- Ensures the bare-metal PM2 deployment and individual Relay container configurations match the standard monorepo TypeScript connection schema and correctly persist user/domain data to the external database rather than falling back to in-memory MOCK instances.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"89d4e0da6caf6317f044a70dc64b015d44238890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/89d4e0da6caf6317f044a70dc64b015d44238890"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/da1d379316f3a60682ded88ff9379448a671b6fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repo