 integrity during sed modifications\n\n- Refactored `deploy_single_vm.sh` to construct a robust `docker-compose.override.yml` instead of destructively parsing and modifying `docker-compose.yml` with `sed`.\n- Resolves a critical bug where declining the local MongoDB would corrupt the YAML structure by leaving behind empty parent keys (`depends_on:`, `volumes:`).\n- Added logic to seamlessly merge both the Nginx/SSL override and the MongoDB scaling override into the same file if both are requested by the user.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d09446616857c458adb946847c373c89f47481ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/d09446616857c458adb946847c373c89f47481ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/ac57309c8e24b493b0bd3b62f97e7136bfc82ebf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscrip