es%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/2a0b5950251735cd38d5cd267931f4c2d1b18696/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:32:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:32:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(deploy): automate certbot ssl and wss routing via nginx\n\n- Prompts users with domains to optionally install Certbot and generate Let''s Encrypt certificates.\n- Generates `default.conf` instructing Nginx to handle SSL termination on port 443.\n- Implements reverse proxy blocks (`location /socket.io/`) to route secure WebSocket traffic to the internal Relay container.\n- Conditionally removes port `:3001` from `VITE_RELAY_URL` when SSL is utilized to prevent WSS handshake failures.\n- Updates README firewall prerequisites for port 443.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"13943d92ea1b3f3cbd72f2075bdfae242479fc0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/13943d92ea1b3f3cbd72f2075bdfae242479fc0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/2a0b5950251735cd38d5cd267931f4c2d1b18696","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":16136987