aving it exclusively in AppleMusicSettingsUI.tsx.\n2. Whitelists `VFS_ALIAS_LIST_RESPONSE` and `VFS_SEARCH_RESPONSE` in `swarm.worker.ts` so the main thread receives the VFS alias dropdown data and search results.\n3. Fixes a web socket spam issue in `LightningSearchUI.tsx` by using a `useRef` for the search query, removing it from the `useEffect` dependency array.\n4. Improves the Storage Tab Remote Dropdown UX by gracefully handling empty remote lists from the backend.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2809411b86306eb0bc04e9e405dbad766263858a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/2809411b86306eb0bc04e9e405dbad766263858a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/c96efd4228a487fa5cf963889765757b0a9e326f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/c96efd4228a487fa5cf963889765757b0a9e326f","node_id":"C_kwDOSlfCadoAKGM5NmVmZDQyMjhhNDg3ZmE1Y2Y5NjM4ODk3NjU3NTdiMGE5ZTMyNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2","sha":"906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2"}],"sha":"c96efd4228a487fa5cf963889765757b0a9e326f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/c96efd4228a487fa5cf963889765757b0a9e326f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T02:12:10Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T02:12:10Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix: resolve apple music config loop and vfs alias worker drop\n\nThis commit fixes multiple frontend bugs:\n1. Resolves a \"Maximum update depth exceeded\" infinite loop in AppleMusicConfigUI.tsx by transitioning away from cyclical `useEffect` syncs to imperative `onChange` handlers.\n2. Whitelists `VFS_ALIAS_LIST_RESPONSE` and `VFS_SEARCH_RESPONSE` in `swarm.worker.ts` so the main thread receives the VFS alias dropdown data and search results.\n3. Fixes a web socket spam issue in `LightningSearchUI.tsx` by using a `useRef` for the search query, removing it from the `useEffect` dependency array, preventing constant teardown/recreation of the socket listener on every keystroke.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7330419df7b4a63cc1b712c2cdd87e19b05c56d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/7330419df7b4a63cc1b712c2cdd87e19b05c56d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2","node_id":"C_kwDOSlfCadoAKDkwNjE1MWQ4MDMzZTYwNzAxMTA1YmUzYzY4YzgyYzFiMzc5MzkzZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e","sha":"3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e"}],"sha":"906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/906151d8033e60701105be3c68c82c1b379393e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T00:58:14Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T00:58:14Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix: resolve infinite loop in AppleMusicConfigUI crashing the React component\n\nThis fixes an issue where navigating to the Apple Music Configuration tab would result in a blank screen due to a \"Maximum update depth exceeded\" error.\n\nThe bug was caused by a two-way reactive state binding between local form states (`selectedFs` and `remotePath`) and the global Zustand store (`rcloneRemote`) using cyclic `useEffect` hooks.\n\nThe solution removes the cyclic dependencies by:\n1. Hydrating the local component state only once on mount.\n2. Updating the global Zustand store imperatively using explicit `onChange` handlers instead of generic `useEffect` watchers.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"44d780735eaaaef23e948d5047cecd5012a6e92a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/44d780735eaaaef23e948d5047cecd5012a6e92a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e","node_id":"C_kwDOSlfCadoAKDNjZTA2NGZkNmIzZWU0OTdjMzlmNWEwN2E2ZGM4MzQwNGNmNmViMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/09ba77a20325f3ca4f341b1a17372fa045824bee","sha":"09ba77a20325f3ca4f341b1a17372fa045824bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/09ba77a20325f3ca4f341b1a17372fa045824bee"}],"sha":"3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/3ce064fd6b3ee497c39f5a07a6dc83404cf6eb1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/09ba77a20325f3ca4f341b1a17372fa045824bee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:18:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:18:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(apple-music): resolve empty dir traversal and hardcoded worker routing\n\n- Update the deep path traversal loop in `worker.ts` to recursively filter out pre-provisioned empty taxonomy directories using `hasFilesRecursively`. It now successfully routes all the way down to the deepest nested album/artist folder instead of breaking early at the taxonomy root.\n- Update `AppleMusicApp.tsx` and `AppleMusicQueueUI.tsx` to dynamically query `useFleetStore` and embed the true active `workerId` into the `Job` object.\n- Replaced hardcoded `''target-worker-id''` strings in WebSocket payloads to ensure the Relay correctly routes cancellation and manual upload commands.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c84b5ef2e64e1d2879f2c60efc32e34933d282d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t