y.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(apple-music): add quick browse shortcut to exact cloud path for completed rips\n\n- Modified backend `worker.ts` to dynamically calculate the deeply nested format/artist/album path generated during the rip before zero-disk cleanup.\n- Appended `uploadPath` to the `RIPPER_TELEMETRY` payload to push the final exact path back to the UI.\n- Extended the frontend `useAppleMusicQueueStore` to persist the `uploadPath`.\n- Introduced `useExplorerStore` to support cross-component global directory targeting.\n- Updated `FileExplorer` to intelligently route to a target directory upon un-mounting/mounting.\n- Added a conditional \"Browse Upload\" button to completed jobs in the `AppleMusicQueueUI` ledger that transports the user straight to the VFS.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b01d2c9f6086bdb1587fef184e04cfb77b0c096f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/b01d2c9f6086bdb1587fef184e04cfb77b0c096f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/f0085fba9970f22ed3d7a4b0b6e1c126d6d5ffcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot