es[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(vfs): implement universal bulk file operations in FileExplorer\n\n- Added `FILE_DELETE_REQUEST`, `FILE_MOVE_REQUEST`, `FILE_COPY_REQUEST`, `FILE_RENAME_REQUEST`, and `FILE_ACTION_RESPONSE` to shared contracts.\n- Updated `RcloneDaemonManager.ts` to execute batch operations natively via `rclone rc` handling both Cloud Remotes and the Local Machine (`/`).\n- Handled backend worker events and updated `swarm.worker.ts` to whitelist action responses for the main thread.\n- Added checkboxes and \"Select All\" functionality into virtualized `react-window` rows in `FileExplorer.tsx`.\n- Implemented a floating action toolbar for mass Delete, Move, Copy, and individual Rename operations.\n- Implemented custom Modal prompts for targeting remotes and bypassing standard media download/stream behaviors.\n- Ensured Playwright visual test verification passed successfully.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9cfb4a89ac2fa7c182b83a64bffcf95afbb7acf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/c9cfb4a89ac2fa7c182b83a64bffcf95afbb7acf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/5df565fb63277d812887575843a18e77c87b1e79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_ur