Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T03:53:35Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"revert(apple-music): remove dummy password trick for Widevine wrapper\n\n- Reverted changes in `AppleMusicWrapperManager.ts` to strictly enforce valid `username` and `password` parameters before starting the proxy. Empirical testing revealed that the `wrapper` binary natively reaches out to Apple servers to verify credentials on every boot, meaning a dummy password string causes a hard crash (\"Check the account information you entered\") even if valid session cookies exist on disk.\n- Reverted changes in `AppleMusicWrapperUI.tsx` to re-enable strict disabled validation on the \"Start Proxy\" and \"Install Wrapper\" buttons. The `password` field is now strictly required for all profiles, including hydrated ones, and the \"Optional if Hydrated\" placeholder has been removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"21c8da00c74a1757653fbff9d44ab87af7ba5f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/21c8da00c74a1757653fbff9d44ab87af7ba5f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/bb14b16548fe175a02b4c7377c62fbc637a82828","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/g