events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/d0a6862806d969fe98122e21620972a447b61be8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T03:04:19Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T03:04:19Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(frontend): whitelist WRAPPER_PROFILES_LIST in background web worker\n\n- Added `MessageType.WRAPPER_PROFILES_LIST` to the `passThroughEvents` array in `frontend/src/worker/swarm.worker.ts`.\n- This resolves a critical UI bug where the frontend React interface failed to receive updated Apple Music DRM profiles from the backend database. The background Web Worker was previously catching the broadcasted payload but silently dropping it because it was not explicitly permitted to pass through to the main React UI thread.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"df875d9edc68d77d5cd61aed6680556997ea427a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/df875d9edc68d77d5cd61aed6680556997ea427a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/d0a6862806d969fe98122e21620972a447b61be8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht