,"html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/bd3eeba63810db4048a065fd09e04d7e1a35595c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T02:35:32Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T02:35:32Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(frontend): elevate fleet state to global store to persist across view changes\n\n- Created `fleetStore.ts` using Zustand to globally manage the `workers` array.\n- Moved the `FLEET_STATE_UPDATE` WebSocket listener from the ephemeral `HorizontalFleetBar.tsx` into the persistent `IDELayout.tsx` component.\n- Refactored `HorizontalFleetBar.tsx` and `FleetSidebar.tsx` to consume the global Zustand state rather than maintaining local state.\n- This resolves a critical UI bug where switching between navigation tabs (e.g., from Explorer to Database Manager and back) caused the Active Worker list to disappear, requiring a manual page refresh to force the Relay Server to re-broadcast the list.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4c18215c0f7140864570f7147b850ac1a24122e","url":"https://api.github.com/