low starting the Widevine proxy without a password if a hydrated session is present. Injects `HYDRATED_DUMMY_PASS` into the CLI arguments to satisfy the binary''s hardcoded `-L` flag requirement while bypassing actual transmission to Apple.\n- Updated `AppleMusicWrapperUI.tsx` to conditionally disable the strict password requirement on the UI buttons. The password is now only required when `selectedProfileId` is falsy or explicitly set to `\"NEW\"`.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3c57e4a406ef7301e02af772c281a1e089f1075","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/f3c57e4a406ef7301e02af772c281a1e089f1075"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/3e128ab524123b3adaa13e0e49cab34332aae804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/3e128ab524123b3adaa13e0e49cab34332aae804","node_id":"C_kwDOSlfCadoAKDNlMTI4YWI1MjQxMjNiM2FkYWExM2UwZTQ5Y2FiMzQzMzJhYWU4MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/bf61fb4636809aaacf881b0db5ce4abb5941a9fb","sha":"bf61fb4636809aaacf881b0db5ce4abb5941a9fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/bf61fb4636809aaacf881b0db5ce4abb5941a9fb"}],"sha":"3e128ab524123b3adaa13e0e49cab34332aae804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/3e128ab524123b3adaa13e0e49cab34332aae804"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/bf61fb4636809aaacf881b0db5ce4abb5941a9fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:49:56Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:49:56Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(apple-music): resolve wrapper shutdown errors, UI state hydration bugs, and add UX feedback\n\n- Added `procps` and `psmisc` to `jules_environment_setup.sh` and `backend/Dockerfile` to fix \"command not found\" errors when the backend worker attempts to safely kill the wrapper proxy using `pkill`, `ps`, and `fuser`.\n- Fixed a React UI state bug in `AppleMusicWrapperUI.tsx` by auto-selecting newly generated DRM profiles from the WebSocket array using `useRef`. This allows graceful transitions from \"NEW\" profile creation without triggering re-renders or WebSocket event spam on keystrokes, and correctly handles edge cases where the user explicitly selects \"NEW\".\n- Enhanced `AppleMusicWrapperManager.ts` to explicitly verify the existence of the `com.apple.android.music` data directory and ensure the exported `tar` payload is >500 bytes to prevent saving empty/poisoned states to the Polyglot Database.\n- Added visual loading/success states and timeout transitions to the `AppleMusicConfigUI` and `AppleMusicSettingsUI` to provide clear UX feedback when saving configurations via WebSockets.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"94f02b7422047029e9d26c24b67e382f7074bcd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/94f02b7422047029e9d26c24b67e382f7074bcd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/bf61fb4636809aaacf881b0db5ce4abb5941a9fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use