signal/commits/5ab8199a9d70072348fe7703963ece5be9fe18ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T17:00:10Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T17:00:10Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(apple-music): implement immutable config snapshots and ledger inspector\n\n- Re-engineered `AppleMusicApp.tsx` dispatch logic to capture a frozen, immutable snapshot of all 30+ UI settings the exact millisecond a job is dispatched.\n- Updated the `AppleMusicQueueUI` with a new \"Ledger Inspector\" tab, allowing users to toggle between live telemetry `stdout` and the read-only JSON config snapshot for any historical job.\n- Updated `APPLE_MUSIC_BACKEND_ARCHITECTURE.md` and `README.md` to document the \"Configuration State Concurrency\" design, explaining how the combination of frontend snapshots and backend VFS Vaults completely eradicates race conditions for concurrent downloads.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9950df4684eabfdd608695ef4deab3dbe12d520b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/9950df4684eabfdd608695ef4deab3dbe12d520b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/5ab8199a9d70072348fe7703963ece5be9fe18ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt