ithub.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/commits/07b143806038fd4c796be60f233784c70058df88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T06:19:52Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T06:19:52Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(worker): Resolve Widevine proxy glibc linker errors and UI auth states\n\n- Refactored `backend/Dockerfile` to use Debian slim (`node:20-bookworm-slim`) for native `glibc` support, fixing `ENOENT` dynamic linker crashes when running the compiled wrapper binary.\n- Added comprehensive CGO build dependencies (`libc6-dev`, `build-essential`, `ca-certificates`) to the backend image to ensure JIT Go cloning and compilation completes without `stdlib.h` missing errors.\n- Handled Apple Music Decryption Wrapper environment variables (`ANDROID_ROOT`, `ANDROID_DATA`, and mapped `/etc/timezone`) via `AppleMusicWrapperManager` to silence fake Android Bionic C library warnings.\n- Secured proxy execution by passing Apple ID credentials strictly as positional arguments via a bash `exec` handoff, mitigating bash string interpolation/command injection.\n- Filtered `stderr` telemetry in the `AppleMusicWrapperManager` to not mischaracterize standard wrapper information streams as errors in the UI.\n- Updated `AppleMusicWrapperUI.tsx` to strictly disable the \"Install Wrapper\" / \"Start Proxy\" buttons unless user credentials (Apple ID and Password) are actively supplied.\n- Verified fixes using Playwright visual testing.\n\nCo-authored-by: tvkk0539 <132346342+tvkk0539@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb621daf877b850dc16878bed746c1d66f57e08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/trees/cb621daf877b850dc16878bed746c1d66f57e08f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvkk0539/signal/git/commits/07b143806038fd4c796be60f233784c70058df88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tvkk0539/signal/commit/07b143806038fd4c796be60f233784c70058df88","node_id":"C_kwDOSlfCadoAKDA3YjE0MzgwNjAzOGZkNGM3OTZiZTYwZjIzMzc4NGM3MDA1OGRmODg","parents":[{"html_url":