","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi","id":24825424,"login":"denis-coccodi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODI1NDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/commits/b66c2103c2b8f228ec84e48dbfeaa9670da248b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T10:39:29Z","email":"denis.coccodi@gmail.com","name":"Denis Coccodi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T10:39:48Z","email":"denis.coccodi@gmail.com","name":"Denis Coccodi"},"message":"chore: upgrade to Nx 23 and Angular 22\n\nUpgrade the workspace to the latest versions that resolve cleanly.\n\n- nx / @nx/angular / @nx/workspace: 22.7.5 -> 23.1.1\n- @angular/* core packages: 21.2.14 -> 22.1.0\n- @angular/cli, devkit, @angular/build: 21.2.14 -> 22.1.3\n- @angular/cdk, @angular/aria: 21.2.14 -> 22.1.1\n- typescript: 5.9.3 -> 6.0.3\n- @ngrx/signals: 21.1.1 -> 22.0.0-rc.0\n- zone.js: 0.15 -> 0.16.2\n- jest-preset-angular: 16.1.5 -> 17.0.0\n- ng-mocks: 14.15.1 -> 14.16.1\n\nTwo upstream ceilings could not be crossed, both hard peer constraints:\n\nTypeScript stops at 6.0.3 rather than the latest 7.0.2, because\n@angular/compiler-cli@22 peers \"typescript >=6.0 <6.1\". TS 7 requires\nAngular 23+.\n\nsingle-spa-angular stays at 21.0.2 and is forced past its\n\"@angular/core >=21.0.0 <22.0.0\" peer cap via a package.json override.\nThere is no v22 release. Every Angular API it imports still exists in\nv22, including the private isPromise internal export, so the cap is\nconservative pinning rather than a real break. Re-verify on the next\nAngular major.\n\nApplied via `nx migrate`, plus one breaking change the migrations did\nnot catch: @angular/aria v22 renamed the Listbox model `values` to\n`value` (`valuesChange` -> `valueChange`). This surfaced as a misleading\n\"Argument of type Event is not assignable to T[]\" build error, since\n$event fell back to the native DOM event. Fixed in the multiselect and\ndropdown templates.\n\nMigrations also added withXhr() to provideHttpClient (v22 defaults to\nfetch) and ChangeDetectionStrategy.Eager to components that had no\nexplicit strategy. Both preserve existing behaviour.\n\nVerified: 111 tests pass, production and single-spa builds succeed, and\nthe app renders in headless Chrome reporting ng-version 22.1.0 with live\nAPI data and no console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce33a163f58ced5cbedd08ad5a76e62f3076ea81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/git/trees/ce33a163f58ced5cbedd08ad5a76e62f3076ea81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/git/commits/b66c2103c2b8f228ec84e48dbfeaa9670da248b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24825424?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi","id":24825424,"login":"denis-coccodi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODI1NDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/commit/b66c2103c2b8f228ec84e48dbfeaa9670da248b7","node_id":"C_kwDOSlmxf9oAKGI2NmMyMTAzYzJiOGYyMjhlYzg0ZTQ4ZGJmZWFhOTY3MGRhMjQ4Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/commit/02ec518c4c77c91f55deaa61b166e5386b9dabbc","sha":"02ec518c4c77c91f55deaa61b166e5386b9dabbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/commits/02ec518c4c77c91f55deaa61b166e5386b9dabbc"}],"sha":"b66c2103c2b8f228ec84e48dbfeaa9670da248b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/commits/b66c2103c2b8f228ec84e48dbfeaa9670da248b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24825424?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi","id":24825424,"login":"denis-coccodi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODI1NDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deni