 managing AI agent skills from agentskill.sh.\n- Added detailed command structure for `/learn`, including subcommands for searching, installing, listing, updating, and rating skills.\n- Implemented a security pattern library in `SECURITY.md` to guide the detection of malicious code in agent skills, including automated tools and manual checks.\n- Established a scoring system for evaluating skill security based on risk levels and patterns.\n- Included instructions for automated skill rating and session skill tracking to enhance user experience and security.","tree":{"sha":"6944615ed8e8cf57393168035ddff0ea701ee8cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/git/trees/6944615ed8e8cf57393168035ddff0ea701ee8cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/git/commits/51bd6cce2e1997d365c432df840169610df7305f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24825424?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi","id":24825424,"login":"denis-coccodi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODI1NDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://githu