T18:38:45Z","email":"denis.coccodi@gmail.com","name":"Denis Coccodi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T18:38:45Z","email":"denis.coccodi@gmail.com","name":"Denis Coccodi"},"message":"test: add unit tests for country components and services\n\n----------------\n CHANGES\n ----------------\n- Added unit tests for `CompareCountriesComponent` to verify initialization, country selection, and computed properties.\n- Created tests for `CountryService` to ensure correct API calls and data handling.\n- Implemented tests for `CountryListComponent` to validate filtering, sorting, and default behaviors.\n- Developed tests for `CountryCardComponent` to check rendering and data formatting.\n- Added tests for `AfghanistanFlagInterceptor` to ensure correct flag replacement logic.\n- Created tests for `PDropdownComponent`, `PInputTextComponent`, `PMultiselectComponent`, and `PHeaderComponent` to validate their functionality and default values.\n- Introduced utility functions in `jest.utils.ts` for creating mock country data.","tree":{"sha":"d03e1e0c071eb9ff3157df02f0653ee971ced173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/git/trees/d03e1e0c071eb9ff3157df02f0653ee971ced173"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/denis-coccodi/angular-countries/git/commits/b630ee23a65301df7aaa9c21c78f1d33287bf232","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24825424?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denis-coccodi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denis-coccodi","id":24825424,"login":"denis-coccodi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODI1NDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.g