ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/commits/df13168314ebcae34fefcf727956ee498f3937f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T21:28:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T21:28:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Refactor all 12 demos into proper multi-file architecture structures\n\nEach demo now splits its code across files that reflect the actual naming\nconventions of its architecture pattern:\n\n- MVC: model/, controller/, view/\n- MVP: model/, presenter/, view/\n- MVVM: model/, viewmodel/, view/\n- HMVC: modules/{Sales,Users,Revenue,Activity}Widget/, dashboard/\n- MVVM-C: coordinator/, viewmodels/, views/\n- VIPER: entity/, interactor/, presenter/, router/, view/\n- Clean Architecture: domain/, application/usecases/, infrastructure/, presentation/\n- Hexagonal: ports/, core/domain/, core/services/, adapters/, ui/\n- Screaming: features/{posts,authors,comments,tags}/\n- Flux/Redux: store/, ui/\n- Micro-Frontend: shell/, mfes/{UserProfile,Notifications,Analytics,Chat}MFE/\n- Atomic Design: atoms/, molecules/, organisms/, templates/, pages/\n\nAll page.tsx files updated to import from their respective layers.\nProduction build verified clean across all 16 routes.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01T8JVSpSUkQiu7nsgktoVHw","tree":{"sha":"f8988842f50b661d7ca08924648343b0fe5e766d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/git/trees/f8988842f50b661d7ca08924648343b0fe5e766d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/git/commits/df13168314ebcae34fefcf727956ee498f3937f0","verification":{"payload":"tree f8988842f50b661d7ca08924648343b0fe5e766d\nparent d3f4643dc9750d91a8e573ef56ae8586417eb757\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779658086 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779658086 +0000\n\nRefactor all 12 demos into proper multi-file architecture structures\n\nEach demo now splits its code across files that reflect the actual naming\nconventions of its architecture pattern:\n\n- MVC: model/, controller/, view/\n- MVP: model/, presenter/, view/\n- MVVM: model/, viewmodel/, view/\n- HMVC: modules/{Sales,Users,Revenue,Activity}Widget/, dashboard/\n- MVVM-C: coordinator/, viewmodels/, views/\n- VIPER: entity/, interactor/, presenter/, router/, view/\n- Clean Architecture: domain/, application/usecases/, infrastructure/, presentation/\n- Hexagonal: ports/, core/domain/, core/services/, adapters/, ui/\n- Screaming: features/{posts,authors,comments,tags}/\n- Flux/Redux: store/, ui/\n- Micro-Frontend: shell/, mfes/{UserProfile,Notifications,Analytics,Chat}MFE/\n- Atomic Design: atoms/, molecules/, organisms/, templates/, pages/\n\nAll page.tsx files updated to import from their respective layers.\nProduction build verified clean across all 16 routes.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01T8JVSpSUkQiu7nsgktoVHw\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQISG5/uc\n1pfK6ckx+GGlXlsXrm7bK/fRyJN8JY4koD6FUKuVedTZMBAWskq9cWqLGsA2x7pdKPyEzKbK/NTi\nyAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T21:28:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/commit/df13168314ebcae34fefcf727956ee498f3937f0","node_id":"C_kwDOSlnAV9oAKGRmMTMxNjgzMTRlYmNhZTM0ZmVmY2Y3Mjc5NTZlZTQ5OGYzOTM3ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/commit/d3f4643dc9750d91a8e573ef56ae8586417eb757","sha":"d3f4643dc9750d91a8e573ef56ae8586417eb757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/commits/d3f4643dc9750d91a8e573ef56ae8586417eb757"}],"sha":"df13168314ebcae34fefcf727956ee498f3937f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/commits/df13168314ebcae34fefcf727956ee498f3937f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/commits/d3f4643dc9750d91a8e573ef56ae8586417eb757/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T09:16:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T09:16:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add 12 interactive frontend architecture demos\n\nBuilds a Next.js 14 app with a dark-themed landing page and one\ninteractive demo per architecture pattern:\n\nClassic:\n- MVC (TodoApp — explicit Model class, Controller hook, dumb Views)\n- MVP (User Profiles — IUserView interface, Presenter drives View)\n- MVVM (Shopping Cart — ViewModel hook mirrors Vue reactive/computed)\n- HMVC (Analytics Dashboard — 4 self-contained widget MVC modules)\n\nExtended:\n- MVVM-C (Registration Wizard — Coordinator owns step navigation)\n- VIPER (News Feed — Interactor, Presenter, Entity, Router layers)\n\nEnterprise:\n- Clean Architecture (Product Catalog — 4 concentric layers, DI)\n- Hexagonal (Weather App — swappable Mock vs Simulated adapters live)\n- Screaming Architecture (Blog Platform — domain-first folder structure)\n\nState / Scale / Design System:\n- Flux/Redux (E-commerce Cart — Store from scratch, live action log)\n- Micro-Frontend (Dashboard Shell — 4 isolated MFEs + event bus)\n- Atomic Design (Component Explorer — Atoms → Pages, interactive)\n\nAll demos: TypeScript strict, zero external UI libs, production build\npasses, deployed as static Next.js routes.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01T8JVSpSUkQiu7nsgktoVHw","tree":{"sha":"80be590d35740069da69ee5387011e27f01ac7fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/git/trees/80be590d35740069da69ee5387011e27f01ac7fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mordonez/demos-frontend-architectures/git/commits/d3f4643dc9750d91a8e573ef56ae8586417eb757","verification":{"payload":"tree 80be590d35740069da69ee5387011e27f01ac7fa\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779527787 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779527787 +0000\n\nAdd 12 interactive frontend architecture demos\n\nBuilds a Next.js 14 app with a dark-themed landing page and one\ninteractive demo per architecture pattern:\n\nClassic:\n- MVC (TodoApp — explicit Model class, Controller hook, dumb Views)\n- MVP (User Profiles — IUserView interface, Presenter drives View)\n- MVVM (Shopping Cart — ViewModel hook mirrors Vue reactive/computed)\n- HMVC (Analytics Dashboard — 4 self-contained widget MVC modules)\n\nExtended:\n- MVVM-C (Registration Wizard — Coordinator owns step navigation)\n- VIPER (News Feed — Interactor, Presenter, Entity, Router layers)\n\nEnterprise:\n- Clean Architecture (Product Catalog — 4 concentric layers, DI)\n- Hexagonal (Weather App — swappable Mock vs Simulated adapters live)\n- Screaming Architecture (Blog Platform — domain-first folder structure)\n\nState / Scale / Design System:\n- Flux/Redux (E-commerce Cart — Store from scratch, live action log)\n- Micro-Frontend (Dashboard Shell — 4 isolated MFEs + event bus)\n- Atomic Design (Component Explorer — Atoms → Pages, interactive)\n\nAll demos: TypeScript strict, zero external UI libs, production build\npasses, deployed as static Next.js routes.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01T8JVSpSUkQiu7nsgktoVHw\n","reason":"valid",