om/TeoSau","id":295132915,"login":"TeoSau","node_id":"U_kgDOEZde8w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeoSau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeoSau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeoSau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeoSau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeoSau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TeoSau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mmss1995/MicroFrontend/commits/e2a5295a043d92e8646ab4294ad6da67240ef201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T14:45:05Z","email":"matteo.sausto@codeland.it","name":"Matteo Sausto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T14:45:05Z","email":"matteo.sausto@codeland.it","name":"Matteo Sausto"},"message":"feat: add VueMounter component and update dev/build scripts\n\nImplemented a VueMounter wrapper to lazily mount Vue micro‑frontend modules within the React shell. Updated the `dev` script to use preview mode for Vue and React workspaces and added a new `build:remotes` script for building remote modules. Bumped `concurrently` to v8.2.0 and updated several Vite and plugin dependencies to newer major versions. Adjusted shell package.json to include Vue, updated federation plugin and Vite versions, and added optional esbuild binaries for cross‑platform support. Updated type declarations for the Vue app export. This change improves micro‑frontend integration and streamlines development and build workflows.","tree":{"sha":"512a849f211fe9987382399c80f47a7b6a09fbfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mmss1995/MicroFrontend/git/trees/512a849f211fe9987382399c80f47a7b6a09fbfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mmss1995/MicroFrontend/git/commits/e2a5295a043d92e8646ab4294ad6da67240ef201","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"ava