","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657","sha":"f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657"}],"sha":"956293d57457f8a9f14a0112bfcb294dab595af8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/956293d57457f8a9f14a0112bfcb294dab595af8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T10:55:38Z","email":"chandan_cc@Chandans-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Chandan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T10:55:38Z","email":"chandan_cc@Chandans-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Chandan"},"message":"fix: replace default Next.js favicon with the CC logo\n\nRemoved favicon.ico and added icon.svg (the white CC mark on the site''s\ndark #1e1e28 background) so the browser tab icon matches the header logo\nand stays visible on both light and dark tab bars.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"829b35b3edb6e1bb827a7281494f837637a4c9b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/git/trees/829b35b3edb6e1bb827a7281494f837637a4c9b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/git/commits/f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657","node_id":"C_kwDOSlreNNoAKGY4ZTg0YzEyYTM0Y2M5ZmY0Zjg2MDkxZjEwY2NmNTk5OWE0ODI2NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322","sha":"a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322"}],"sha":"f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/f8e84c12a34cc9ff4f86091f10ccf5999a482657"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T10:53:41Z","email":"chandan_cc@Chandans-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Chandan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T10:53:41Z","email":"chandan_cc@Chandans-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Chandan"},"message":"fix: replace next/image with asset() helper so images load on GitHub Pages\n\nNext.js Image does not inject basePath into static export HTML, causing\nall public assets to 404 at /get-to-know-me sub-path. Swapped every\n<Image> usage in about, home, Nav and SkillsSection for plain <img> with\nthe asset() utility that prepends the basePath in production.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c50a16e27ffb0f02c7ede32536bb55092f59945c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/git/trees/c50a16e27ffb0f02c7ede32536bb55092f59945c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/git/commits/a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322","node_id":"C_kwDOSlreNNoAKGE5ZmJiOGFkOGQ2NmQyNjIwOTBhYWViMmQ3YmI0OGZlMTYyZmIzMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/0ca05d12b10067296cf3139d29e781cee77713be","sha":"0ca05d12b10067296cf3139d29e781cee77713be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/0ca05d12b10067296cf3139d29e781cee77713be"}],"sha":"a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/a9fbb8ad8d66d262090aaeb2d7bb48fe162fb322"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commits/0ca05d12b10067296cf3139d29e781cee77713be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T10:43:50Z","email":"chandan_cc@Chandans-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Chandan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T10:43:50Z","email":"chandan_cc@Chandans-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Chandan"},"message":"Build all portfolio components and pages\n\nLayout:\n- Nav (client) — active state, mobile menu with scroll lock\n- LeftStrip — fixed social icons\n- Footer — identical across all pages\n\nShared:\n- Icons — GitHub, LinkedIn, Email SVGs\n- SectionHeading — #label ──── pattern\n- ProjectCard — typed Project props, tech splitting, badge, metric\n- SkillsSection — reused on home + about\n\nPages (all 4 statically generated):\n- / (home) — Hero, Stats, Quote, Projects preview, Skills, About preview, Contacts preview\n- /about — Bio with <strong> highlights, Skills, Experience timeline, Achievements, Education\n- /projects — Personal (3-col) + Professional (2-col) project grids\n- /contacts — Contact rows, availability box, all-media, resume download\n\nAll content sourced from @/data — no hardcoded strings in JSX\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8dc1eb1312f9f749da61d1ce62a60124b74597a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/git/trees/8dc1eb1312f9f749da61d1ce62a60124b74597a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/git/commits/0ca05d12b10067296cf3139d29e781cee77713be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/0ca05d12b10067296cf3139d29e781cee77713be","node_id":"C_kwDOSlreNNoAKDBjYTA1ZDEyYjEwMDY3Mjk2Y2YzMTM5ZDI5ZTc4MWNlZTc3NzEzYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChandanCC/get-to-know-me/commit/fa