inal→wrapped\n  handlers so off() can find and remove the correct wrapped handler\n- Fix clearByOwner to only clean OrionBus channel, not all EventBus channels\n- Fix TypeScript compile errors: emit() and clearByOwner() need internal\n  Channel access, not ChannelPublicAPI\n- Fix create-app.js: return → continue in binary file detection loop\n  (return was skipping all remaining files in the directory)\n- Add SubAppCache.destroy() to clear periodic TTL cleanup timer","tree":{"sha":"747d50a6c9d8a94c41153c3de52d5978677f41ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyzheal/orion-mf/git/trees/747d50a6c9d8a94c41153c3de52d5978677f41ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyzheal/orion-mf/git/commits/28a82ea5fdb6bdbd1751f5c40dd8e2e3e3becd72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zyzheal/orion-mf/commit/28a82ea5fdb6bdbd1751f5c40dd8e2e3e3becd72","node_id":"C_kwDOSlvopdoAKDI4YTgyZWE1ZmRiNmJkYmQxNzUxZjVjNDBkZDhlMmUzZTNiZWNkNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyzheal/orion-mf/commit/7bb465095e3be52279dbd723390cf392b27e4dd8","sha":"7bb465095e3be52279dbd723390cf392b27e4dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyzheal/orion-mf/commits/7bb465095e3be52279dbd723390cf392b27e4dd8"}],"sha":"28a82ea5fdb6bdbd1751f5c40dd8e2e3e3becd72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyzheal/orion-mf/commits/28a82ea5fdb6bdbd1751f5c40dd8e2e3e3becd72"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyzheal/orion-mf/commits/7bb465095e3be52279dbd723390cf392b27e4dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T15:19:42Z","email":"healscm@gmail.com","name":"heal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T15:19:42Z","email":"healscm@gmail.com","name":"heal"},"message":"fix: Phase 2 - OrionBus dedup, SubAppCache TTL+stampede, npmignore, template validation\n\n- Merge OrionBus to use EventBus channel under the hood, remove\n  duplicate listeners/ownerHandlers impl